1
00:02:03,890 --> 00:02:07,830
No living was harmed during the
production of this series.

2
00:02:08,225 --> 00:02:14,275
Visit our website for more: turkision.com

3
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:22,039
Let my children go take me.

4
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:25,999
No!
I healed your disabled son!

5
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:29,279
I wanted you beside me.

6
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,599
But you stood against me!

7
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:36,239
You will pay the price with his life.

8
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,959
Stop!

9
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:40,559
Stop.

10
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:42,759
They are young.

11
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:47,519
They can...
They can obey.

12
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:51,039
You will spare their lives now.

13
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:54,559
Take my life.

14
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:58,519
Take my life. Or else...

15
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:03,359
...I will try beheading you
even in my last breath!

16
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:09,439
Come on. Take me.
Take me, so the frontiers will be yours.

17
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:13,559
My children will go to Yenisehir with Boran.

18
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:19,639
And you will cut my head off.

19
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,599
What do I..

20
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,279
..have left...

21
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:29,199
...but to die on this way anyway?

22
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:33,999
Osman, the man who convinced the...

23
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:36,239
...shepherd Turks...

24
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:40,599
...Osman who ignited the fire...

25
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,559
..of the dawah (case) in their hearts.

26
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:48,479
Let his children live..

27
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:51,679
...so they can be our slaves.

28
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,679
Nayman.

29
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:57,279
They can only be slaves!

30
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:03,119
My children..

31
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,399
My children..

32
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:19,279
I will put your head on the tip of my spear...

33
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:22,799
...and visit all the tribes, Osman.

34
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,039
It's over!

35
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:30,559
I will say that
they are all my slaves.

36
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:42,519
Come. Come.

37
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:46,079
Archers.

38
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:54,279
Why should I let the children live...

39
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:59,319
...and give them a chance to take revenge, Nayman?

40
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,719
Kill them!

41
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,919
O Haqq!

42
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:32,519
We arrived, Osman Bey!

43
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:38,559
-My children... Are you alright?
-We are alright, father.

44
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:43,119
My children... Take my children away!

45
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:57,639
Hang on, Osman Bey.

46
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:06,319
-This way...
-O Allah..

47
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,759
Ya Allah.

48
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:09,999
Osman

49
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:12,199
Where are you going, Osman?!

50
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:14,799
I will cut your children's heads off...

51
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:17,679
...and give them to their mothers!

52
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:20,519
Do not let them escape!

53
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:35,719
This forest is mine!

54
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,919
Catch them

55
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,839
There are no traces here.

56
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,239
We won't stop before we find Osman Bey, Alps.

57
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:29,919
There is blood on the ground.

58
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,519
Traces lead this way.

59
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:47,759
The blood is fresh. Let's go now, brothers!

60
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:11,359
Let's leave a trace..

61
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:15,119
...so if someone comes for help, they can find us.

62
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:17,519
Come on brothers, let's go now!

63
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,119
Thank you, Salur Bey. Thank you.

64
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:29,919
My children.. Are you alright?

65
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:34,279
We are going to Salur Bey's tribe.
But we will not use the main road...

66
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:37,719
...since we attacked them from north...

67
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:40,739
...now we have to go from the west.

68
00:08:40,739 --> 00:08:43,979
We will build a line of defense there.
Come on Alps.

69
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:53,999
Split! Go everywhere! So...

70
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:56,999
...they cannot follow us.

71
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:55,119
Where did you go, Osman?

72
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:59,919
You will find Osman right now! Split!

73
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:06,279
I can smell Osman's blood
from somewhere close, Lord.

74
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,359
They are close.

75
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:17,719
My Lord. We found him.

76
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:20,919
One trace shows this way the other leads to Aksu.

77
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:24,719
They parted their ways to split our power.

78
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:27,719
The one who leaves the herd gets caught by a wolf.

79
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:30,039
Now they are cornered.

80
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:33,399
Go into the woods and bring me his head!

81
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:14,199
Not only have I settled in there...

82
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:17,719
...I am now at Nayman's service.

83
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:21,119
Good.

84
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,839
So you gained Nayman's trust.

85
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:28,839
I am as close to him as his helper Tendu.

86
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,679
Good.

87
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:37,319
Then we will have this thing done tonight, Ayceren.

88
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:42,119
You will take that seal from Nayman.

89
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:46,079
First, the army that gathered
behind Nayman will leave him...

90
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:49,159
...then his head will leave his body.

91
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,639
Yenisehir
Osman Bey's mansion.

92
00:12:00,599 --> 00:12:01,599
My flower.

93
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:05,880
I was afraid that something
would happen to you.

94
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:08,519
I was afraid as well.

95
00:12:09,059 --> 00:12:11,919
I was afraid that I wouldn't be
able to protect our child.

96
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:14,559
However, I knew you would come.

97
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:17,799
You keep your promise.

98
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:20,319
Our child.

99
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:25,719
-We will have a child.
-Yes.

100
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:29,679
I wanted to tell you the news personally,
however..

101
00:12:29,880 --> 00:12:31,839
It was not in our destiny.

102
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:36,799
It's alright my flower.
You can give me the news next time.

103
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:40,239
And..

104
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,519
I think it will be a girl.

105
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:47,519
She will look like her mother.

106
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:49,879
She will be a brave one like her mother.

107
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:56,039
No, I don't think so.

108
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:59,759
I think it will be a brave boy like his father, Aktemur.

109
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,599
Alcicek..

110
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:06,319
You gave me the world.

111
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:10,119
And Allah granted me with you.

112
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:23,199
Don't take these off again, alright?

113
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:41,119
Let me go and check.

114
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:26,199
ueiuso

115
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:40,439
Tell me, where is Osman?

116
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:44,919
Where is he, what happened

117
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:54,039
Alps!

118
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:58,639
Bring your swords,
send word to sisters and bring the horses.

119
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:02,119
Iltutan wouldn't leave Osman,
they are in trouble.

120
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:05,919
Malhun went to check the bazaar
quickly send word Bengi Hatun.

121
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:09,079
-Everyone is in your hands.
-Don't worry, come on.

122
00:15:09,600 --> 00:15:10,639
Aunt.

123
00:15:11,400 --> 00:15:13,959
-I will come with you.
-Quickly.

124
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:17,919
My valiant, let's go. Bring the horses!

125
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:19,599
Quickly.

126
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:22,319
Alps, bring my armor.

127
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:32,719
Give me.

128
00:15:33,560 --> 00:15:35,359
Iltutan, let's go my valiant.

129
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:37,719
Take us to Osman our children.

130
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:40,319
Quickly, quickly!

131
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:45,119
Salur Bey is coming

132
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:48,399
-There are woundeds!
-Thank you, Salur Bey.

133
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:53,799
- You host us in your tents.
- Of course, Osman Bey.

134
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:55,919
Osman Bey is here.

135
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:59,119
Hear me out people! Be prepared!

136
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,879
There are woundeds!

137
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:03,359
Find the healers quickly!

138
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:04,879
People!

139
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:09,319
Gather around!

140
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:12,039
Quickly, I told you..

141
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:15,799
We came, however,
we brought trouble with us.

142
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:19,639
What will we do, Bey?

143
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:23,039
Now, everyone will form a defence line.

144
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:24,679
Salur Bey.

145
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:28,119
Now, you will bring me..

146
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:31,919
All the bows, arrows and swords you have.

147
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:35,399
Now, this place is not a tribe..

148
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:39,599
-It is Turks' last castle.
-As you wish, Bey.

149
00:16:40,520 --> 00:16:41,799
Quickly!

150
00:16:42,440 --> 00:16:45,599
Come on, faster!

151
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:50,399
Archers, gather around

152
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:53,879
Bring all the shields, quickly!

153
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:59,639
Close the doors!

154
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:24,519
Murat..

155
00:17:25,280 --> 00:17:26,199
Where to?

156
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:29,409
You said that the ones who can
hold sword could join you, Osman Bey.

157
00:17:29,409 --> 00:17:30,789
I can hold a sword.

158
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:32,959
No...

159
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:35,639
No way.

160
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:38,039
We fall to the ground for you.

161
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:40,399
My son.
No!

162
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:44,839
You will grow up,
you will become a valiant.

163
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:52,319
After that,
you will clash like a valiant with us.

164
00:17:54,600 --> 00:17:57,199
For Allah's sake.

165
00:17:57,640 --> 00:18:01,719
For Allah's sake.
Come on now, get back to your tent.

166
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:04,999
Alright, son? Alps, look here!

167
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:08,039
-Take this kid.
-As you command.

168
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:12,599
Come on my son, come on..

169
00:18:15,520 --> 00:18:17,319
Bring fire, Alps

170
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:19,439
Bring the healers quickly!

171
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,839
Bring fire!

172
00:18:33,520 --> 00:18:34,719
The tracks..

173
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:37,559
Lead to a little tribe, my Lord.

174
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:42,519
They've sheltered in the tribe.

175
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:46,959
They've sheltered in their own graves.

176
00:18:47,800 --> 00:18:52,079
We will burn down the tribe,
and let their blood flow, Lord.

177
00:18:55,360 --> 00:18:57,359
Nokers!

178
00:18:58,480 --> 00:19:01,159
Burn down the tribe that sheltered Osman.

179
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:03,759
Hang their heads on pikes.

180
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:05,719
Quickly!

181
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:08,159
Stop, Nayman

182
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:15,959
I won't let Osman get away again.

183
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:21,839
If Osman is sheltered in the tribe,
he must have a trick up his sleeve.

184
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:27,359
I will wait for soldiers
scattered around the forest to come.

185
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:29,999
And then, I will destroy that tribe.

186
00:19:30,320 --> 00:19:32,879
Osman is in our claws, Lord.

187
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:35,999
Osman's fate is death.

188
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:40,279
Osman will not escape his fate anymore.

189
00:19:45,800 --> 00:19:48,919
Come on! Come on, people!
Faster!

190
00:19:49,680 --> 00:19:52,519
My Bey, let me cauterize it.

191
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:55,999
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate. O Healer!

192
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:58,839
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate. Come on, Boran.

193
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:02,479
Come on.

194
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:12,639
You'll be alright my Bey.

195
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:24,439
I'm good.

196
00:20:24,840 --> 00:20:27,279
No! Alps!

197
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:29,479
Don't close the entrance!

198
00:20:29,560 --> 00:20:31,799
If we close, they will try to destroy it.

199
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:35,039
But if we leave a narrow entrance, they will enter.

200
00:20:35,040 --> 00:20:37,239
In a narrow place, numbers don't matter.

201
00:20:37,240 --> 00:20:39,119
We'll be equal.

202
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:47,319
Salur Bey, where is the Greek Fire
that we gave you?

203
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:50,439
That way, Orhan Bey.

204
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:53,079
What is it, son?

205
00:20:53,120 --> 00:20:56,679
My Bey, we'll hold the narrow passage
as long as we can.

206
00:20:57,080 --> 00:20:58,759
When we are out of strength...

207
00:20:58,840 --> 00:21:02,519
...they will burn in our fire.
The fire of our rage.

208
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:04,639
EyvAllah, son.

209
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:06,999
EyvAllah.

210
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:11,039
-With your permission, father.
-Go ahead.

211
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:12,599
Go ahead.

212
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:19,959
We'll defend this place.

213
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:23,319
-We'll defend it somehow.
-We will, my Bey.

214
00:21:23,760 --> 00:21:27,319
Great effort you're showing. Thank you.

215
00:21:28,320 --> 00:21:30,159
Thank you.

216
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,639
Thank you.

217
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:36,759
You didn't say our tribe was small...

218
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:40,239
...but you armed us and gave us
the Greek fire.

219
00:21:40,480 --> 00:21:43,959
Now I see why you did, Osman Bey.

220
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:48,119
EyvAllah, Salur Bey.
EyvAllah.

221
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:52,359
We won't leave this place. We won't.

222
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:56,679
We will defend it for sure.

223
00:21:57,360 --> 00:21:59,119
We'll defend it for sure.

224
00:21:59,360 --> 00:22:01,639
Come, dastards.

225
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:05,359
This is the last fortress of Turks.
You won't be able to pass.

226
00:22:06,360 --> 00:22:08,599
You won't be able to pass.

227
00:22:11,280 --> 00:22:13,919
Come. Just come.

228
00:22:35,480 --> 00:22:37,239
Trails here!

229
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:42,919
Kayi sign.

230
00:22:43,560 --> 00:22:46,919
This way! Come on!

231
00:23:00,080 --> 00:23:01,879
Come on, Orhan.

232
00:23:02,160 --> 00:23:03,759
Come on, son.

233
00:23:04,320 --> 00:23:07,679
Come on, son. Come on. Come, come.

234
00:23:07,840 --> 00:23:09,999
Come. Jump in.

235
00:23:33,160 --> 00:23:34,839
Come.

236
00:23:35,040 --> 00:23:37,879
Come here, vile dogs!

237
00:23:49,240 --> 00:23:50,959
Osman

238
00:23:52,120 --> 00:23:55,479
Instead of dying alone in the woods

239
00:23:56,360 --> 00:23:58,479
..you took shelter in this tribe.

240
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:03,119
This will just increase the number of people
who are going to die with you.

241
00:24:03,160 --> 00:24:04,879
We'll see.

242
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:07,199
We'll see.

243
00:24:07,280 --> 00:24:10,999
You can't run anymore, Osman

244
00:24:11,200 --> 00:24:13,519
I thought you were a brave man.

245
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:20,479
People in the tribe!

246
00:24:21,120 --> 00:24:24,039
You don't have to die with Osman.

247
00:24:24,840 --> 00:24:28,319
Just give him to me and I will spare your lives.

248
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:31,279
Delivering Osman Bey would be...

249
00:24:31,640 --> 00:24:34,079
...delivering the freedom of Turks!

250
00:24:34,080 --> 00:24:36,719
Osman Bey is the hope of Turks!

251
00:24:36,840 --> 00:24:41,239
-We won't deliver Osman Bey!
-Osman Bey is the hope of Turks!

252
00:24:42,800 --> 00:24:44,839
This is the land of Turks.

253
00:24:45,280 --> 00:24:47,639
Do your best.

254
00:24:48,080 --> 00:24:50,319
We won't fall easily.

255
00:24:50,720 --> 00:24:53,839
We won't fall easily!

256
00:24:55,360 --> 00:24:58,279
I just gave you a chance.

257
00:24:59,040 --> 00:25:01,119
Dying all together...

258
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:02,959
...is your choice!

259
00:25:03,200 --> 00:25:05,759
Just come and try, Lord

260
00:25:06,120 --> 00:25:08,799
We will die but not deliver Osman Bey!

261
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:10,599
Come!

262
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:13,999
Just come. Sons.

263
00:25:16,720 --> 00:25:18,679
Salur Bey.

264
00:25:19,120 --> 00:25:22,439
People! We won't fall easily!

265
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:26,079
Attack!

266
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:35,319
Wait.

267
00:25:37,720 --> 00:25:39,599
Wait.

268
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:44,119
Wait.

269
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:52,319
Now!

270
00:25:52,360 --> 00:25:57,239
Allah is the greatest!

271
00:25:59,480 --> 00:26:01,479
Shield wall!

272
00:26:05,720 --> 00:26:06,879
O Allah!

273
00:26:06,880 --> 00:26:08,839
Allah is the greatest!

274
00:26:09,000 --> 00:26:11,439
Allah is the greatest!

275
00:26:12,200 --> 00:26:13,999
Allah is the greatest!

276
00:26:14,840 --> 00:26:16,679
Ya Haqq!

277
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:20,439
Allah is the greatest!

278
00:26:21,480 --> 00:26:24,839
-O Allah!
-Allah is the greatest!

279
00:26:51,920 --> 00:26:54,199
They found the trails we put.

280
00:27:02,000 --> 00:27:04,959
Any news from Osman Bey? Where is he?

281
00:27:05,920 --> 00:27:08,079
We're looking for him too, Bala Hatun.

282
00:27:08,360 --> 00:27:11,599
-Trails show this way.
-What trails?

283
00:27:14,280 --> 00:27:15,879
Bala Hatun.

284
00:27:19,000 --> 00:27:21,279
There was blood on the ground.

285
00:27:28,200 --> 00:27:30,799
What are we going to do now, Bala Hatun?

286
00:27:33,560 --> 00:27:35,799
The nearest place is Salur Tribe.

287
00:27:36,360 --> 00:27:39,879
They must have taken shelter there.
We're going there. Come on.

288
00:27:45,360 --> 00:27:47,319
Allah is the greatest!

289
00:27:47,360 --> 00:27:49,559
Allah is the greatest!

290
00:27:50,560 --> 00:27:53,479
Ya Allah

291
00:27:53,560 --> 00:27:55,719
Allah is the greatest!

292
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:59,639
Allah is the greatest!

293
00:28:07,440 --> 00:28:10,759
We're out of arrows, my Bey.
We can't hold much longer.

294
00:28:11,760 --> 00:28:13,239
Now it's time, father.

295
00:28:13,440 --> 00:28:16,599
Just wait. Get prepared.

296
00:28:22,320 --> 00:28:24,239
They're out of arrows.

297
00:28:27,160 --> 00:28:29,119
Attack!

298
00:28:30,920 --> 00:28:32,519
Now!

299
00:28:33,160 --> 00:28:35,519
Ya Haqq!

300
00:28:51,480 --> 00:28:54,919
What a hopeless attempt to survive!

301
00:28:55,000 --> 00:28:56,399
Whatever he does

302
00:28:56,600 --> 00:28:59,639
...both Osman and his sons are going to die today.

303
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:07,199
My Bey, more are coming. What are we going to do?

304
00:29:07,560 --> 00:29:10,839
-We have nothing left to do, father.
-Well, sons.

305
00:29:11,280 --> 00:29:14,879
Today, we're going to die here or...

306
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:18,079
...or this place will remain as a land of Turks!

307
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:21,759
Not every son finds a chance to
become martyr with his father.

308
00:29:21,800 --> 00:29:23,519
I'm happy.

309
00:29:23,680 --> 00:29:27,119
Final destination is martyrdom, father. Now or later.

310
00:29:27,360 --> 00:29:30,599
-Together, InshaAllah.
-Together, sons.

311
00:29:30,920 --> 00:29:33,479
Together, people

312
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:37,519
O Allah!

313
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:45,839
Attack!

314
00:29:52,480 --> 00:29:54,399
I'm here, Osman Bey!

315
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:56,239
Bala!

316
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:04,919
Shield wall!

317
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:10,199
Ya Haqq!

318
00:30:11,360 --> 00:30:13,159
Nayman

319
00:30:13,720 --> 00:30:16,039
Stay together!

320
00:30:18,240 --> 00:30:20,199
Stay together!

321
00:30:26,040 --> 00:30:29,959
Now we're outnumbered, Lord.

322
00:30:32,800 --> 00:30:34,759
I'm not like you, Nayman.

323
00:30:35,160 --> 00:30:37,039
I will not tolerate defeat!

324
00:30:37,160 --> 00:30:39,039
Lord, not now!

325
00:30:42,680 --> 00:30:45,679
We're retreating,
we're drawing back.

326
00:30:50,680 --> 00:30:52,239
O Allah

327
00:30:58,840 --> 00:31:01,679
This is a land of Turks!

328
00:31:01,840 --> 00:31:08,079
Allah is the greatest!

329
00:31:08,160 --> 00:31:11,279
Allah is the greatest!

330
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:13,559
O Allah.

331
00:31:13,600 --> 00:31:23,119
Allah is the greatest!

332
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:30,199
I'm curious about Osman
and the children.

333
00:31:30,240 --> 00:31:32,159
-I can't stand this.
-Malhun Hatun.

334
00:31:32,240 --> 00:31:35,599
If you leave now,
you will risk your life and your child's life.

335
00:31:37,200 --> 00:31:39,799
Have patience for a while longer Malhun.

336
00:31:39,960 --> 00:31:41,759
I know your test is tough.

337
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:43,879
But Yenisehir is trusted to you.

338
00:31:44,200 --> 00:31:46,679
Think about your child's life, if not yours.

339
00:31:46,840 --> 00:31:49,239
InshaAllah we will receive good news soon.

340
00:31:56,640 --> 00:32:00,199
We have received news,
Osman Bey is all right and they are coming.

341
00:32:01,200 --> 00:32:04,279
-Thankfully.
-Thankfully.

342
00:32:05,760 --> 00:32:07,519
Thankfully.

343
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:15,399
Do you see, new sibling is coming,

344
00:32:15,960 --> 00:32:17,999
so they forgot about you just like me.

345
00:32:18,640 --> 00:32:21,519
But don't worry, I'm here.

346
00:32:24,160 --> 00:32:26,319
I will never leave you alone sister.

347
00:32:30,480 --> 00:32:34,879
My Bey, as you ordered, we sent an alp
to inform Yenisehir about the situation.

348
00:32:35,240 --> 00:32:38,519
What about the situation in Konya?

349
00:32:39,000 --> 00:32:41,839
Sultan Mesut did not give up when the troops were hit.

350
00:32:42,200 --> 00:32:45,439
Support unit of Jandarids is coming to the frontiers.

351
00:32:49,880 --> 00:32:53,879
Here, our salvation depends on this unit.

352
00:33:01,200 --> 00:33:02,439
...x 'tJJ

353
00:33:05,280 --> 00:33:06,879
Osman Bey.

354
00:33:07,880 --> 00:33:10,599
Kids, Bala.

355
00:33:10,880 --> 00:33:14,039
People are all right,
thankfully we didn't lose many people.

356
00:33:15,120 --> 00:33:17,999
Here, Bala Hatun. Thank you.

357
00:33:25,960 --> 00:33:27,359
Thankfully.

358
00:33:27,840 --> 00:33:30,759
Thankfully we have repelled this trouble as well.

359
00:33:30,800 --> 00:33:33,359
-Thankfully.
-Thankfully.

360
00:33:35,320 --> 00:33:37,519
Kids performed a great resistance.

361
00:33:42,120 --> 00:33:44,439
You came right on time, Bala.

362
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:48,959
But most importantly

363
00:33:49,400 --> 00:33:52,439
Salur Bey and his people.

364
00:33:53,840 --> 00:33:58,119
They fought so hard, we're glad
to have them, may Allah bless them.

365
00:33:58,880 --> 00:34:00,679
May Allah bless you too, Osman Bey.

366
00:34:00,760 --> 00:34:02,839
Our courage derives from you, Osman Bey.

367
00:34:03,120 --> 00:34:05,879
Astagfirullah. Astagfirullah.
Astagfirullah.

368
00:34:06,000 --> 00:34:09,679
While we were wandering idly
to find a land to settle,

369
00:34:10,960 --> 00:34:12,719
...you gave us a home.

370
00:34:13,560 --> 00:34:16,399
You put the da'wah of holy war in our hearts.

371
00:34:17,159 --> 00:34:19,279
It is our duty to be with you

372
00:34:19,679 --> 00:34:21,438
in your hard day, Osman Bey.

373
00:34:21,639 --> 00:34:25,679
No. We gave lands to many...

374
00:34:26,600 --> 00:34:29,759
...but they turned their back on us
in our hardest day.

375
00:34:32,199 --> 00:34:34,799
Do you know what's the real courage, Salur Bey?

376
00:34:37,080 --> 00:34:38,478
The real courage

377
00:34:39,239 --> 00:34:41,438
is the loyalty

378
00:34:42,280 --> 00:34:44,359
that showed in the hard day.

379
00:34:50,760 --> 00:34:53,359
But we have harder days ahead.

380
00:34:55,360 --> 00:34:58,519
We couldn't hit the commanders.
We couldn't stop the army.

381
00:35:03,200 --> 00:35:04,839
We're in a hard spot.

382
00:35:06,880 --> 00:35:08,919
But the greatest healing...

383
00:35:09,520 --> 00:35:11,439
...is our unity.

384
00:35:13,160 --> 00:35:14,319
Here...

385
00:35:15,720 --> 00:35:17,759
...those who didn't even see our faces...

386
00:35:18,280 --> 00:35:20,879
...became shields for us today.

387
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:23,279
May Allah bless them all.

388
00:35:23,640 --> 00:35:25,879
-Ameen.
-Ameen.

389
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:29,319
As long as you support us...

390
00:35:29,600 --> 00:35:32,399
...we will never be defeated.

391
00:35:34,200 --> 00:35:37,159
-May Allah have our unity last forever.
-Ameen.

392
00:35:40,480 --> 00:35:41,839
-Boran.
-My Bey.

393
00:35:42,080 --> 00:35:43,879
Send alps everywhere.

394
00:35:43,920 --> 00:35:46,479
Find out how many people are there in that army,

395
00:35:46,480 --> 00:35:49,319
where will they pass, find out their whole route.

396
00:35:50,600 --> 00:35:53,479
Yes my Bey. Come on brother.

397
00:35:57,040 --> 00:35:59,359
Kids, Bala.

398
00:36:00,680 --> 00:36:03,079
Let us leave.

399
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:07,359
Thank you for everything.

400
00:36:08,440 --> 00:36:11,679
-Give us your pardon.
-Of course, Osman Bey.

401
00:36:12,120 --> 00:36:14,039
Give us your pardon.

402
00:36:14,360 --> 00:36:15,919
I do.

403
00:36:18,560 --> 00:36:20,759
Come on now.

404
00:36:20,960 --> 00:36:23,079
-Come on.
-Come on kids.

405
00:36:33,320 --> 00:36:34,679
Lord.

406
00:36:35,040 --> 00:36:37,239
Osman's family

407
00:36:37,400 --> 00:36:40,199
they are risking their lives to protect him.

408
00:36:41,360 --> 00:36:43,719
If I didn't have the seal

409
00:36:44,200 --> 00:36:48,999
maybe most of those behind me would try to kill me.

410
00:36:50,320 --> 00:36:53,479
Osman's greatest power is his family.

411
00:36:54,440 --> 00:36:58,079
They all look like they have been captivated.

412
00:37:05,880 --> 00:37:07,519
Soldiers!

413
00:37:22,800 --> 00:37:24,759
Dismount from the horses.

414
00:37:32,520 --> 00:37:34,079
Soldiers and horses

415
00:37:34,800 --> 00:37:37,079
will go to the castle separately.

416
00:37:37,840 --> 00:37:39,199
You will walk!

417
00:37:39,600 --> 00:37:41,999
Yes, mighty Lord.

418
00:38:00,040 --> 00:38:02,359
If I told them to die

419
00:38:03,120 --> 00:38:04,919
they would die, Nayman.

420
00:38:05,920 --> 00:38:08,319
Also I don't have any seal.

421
00:38:10,360 --> 00:38:14,759
If it's out of fear, why would a soldier
who is ready to sacrifice his life be afraid?

422
00:38:16,120 --> 00:38:17,919
If it's loyalty, then be it.

423
00:38:18,320 --> 00:38:20,439
If it's people, then be it.

424
00:38:22,760 --> 00:38:27,119
I'm strong enough to crush Osman under my feet.

425
00:38:28,280 --> 00:38:31,839
And this is just a beginning.

426
00:38:32,960 --> 00:38:35,959
When you see the ones who unite under my banner,

427
00:38:37,160 --> 00:38:40,359
you will see what does it mean to be captivated.

428
00:38:44,880 --> 00:38:47,159
Let the armies come quickly.

429
00:38:47,640 --> 00:38:49,999
We will not be defeated again, Lord!

430
00:38:52,880 --> 00:38:54,959
The army will not come for now.

431
00:38:55,560 --> 00:38:57,679
What do you mean they won't?

432
00:38:58,680 --> 00:39:02,319
First, I want a leading troop
that's made of the strongest ones.

433
00:39:03,040 --> 00:39:04,879
They will be capable of hiding.

434
00:39:05,040 --> 00:39:07,919
Their strength will be equal to a lion's strength.

435
00:39:07,920 --> 00:39:09,959
They will not miss their shoots.

436
00:39:10,480 --> 00:39:13,159
A leading troop that's made of the wildest ones.

437
00:39:15,720 --> 00:39:17,279
What will they do?

438
00:39:18,200 --> 00:39:21,119
You saw the loyalty of
the people who follow Osman.

439
00:39:21,720 --> 00:39:25,199
They will come and they will destroy them.

440
00:39:25,840 --> 00:39:28,599
Their soldiers, their commanders.

441
00:39:28,800 --> 00:39:30,439
Their beys, all of them

442
00:39:30,640 --> 00:39:33,279
They will destroy everyone
who believes in Osman!

443
00:39:37,200 --> 00:39:39,439
Keep your army ready, Nayman.

444
00:39:40,160 --> 00:39:41,559
When it is over

445
00:39:42,040 --> 00:39:44,839
all the rivers will be blood-red.

446
00:39:51,560 --> 00:39:52,879
This time

447
00:39:53,440 --> 00:39:57,039
you will not be able to escape, Osman.

448
00:40:19,120 --> 00:40:20,239
Thanks to Allah.

449
00:40:20,720 --> 00:40:23,559
We are getting over every move of our enemies.

450
00:40:24,320 --> 00:40:25,799
What is your intention now?

451
00:40:30,280 --> 00:40:31,919
You know my intention, my Bala.

452
00:40:32,080 --> 00:40:34,839
My intention is to stab the infidels' heart.

453
00:40:36,960 --> 00:40:38,839
Look, I did not know that.

454
00:40:39,600 --> 00:40:41,199
You say it is a secret, ha?

455
00:40:41,920 --> 00:40:44,279
A secret that you also hide from me.

456
00:40:46,360 --> 00:40:49,559
EyvAllah Osman Bey. EyvAllah.

457
00:40:50,680 --> 00:40:51,839
My Bala.

458
00:40:54,320 --> 00:40:57,199
Our intention is to ruin the dreams of our enemies.

459
00:40:57,240 --> 00:40:59,479
You already know that. Come here. Come.

460
00:41:04,200 --> 00:41:06,319
Good, good. I understood.

461
00:41:06,720 --> 00:41:09,719
Fortunately, we are in a hurry for something good...

462
00:41:10,360 --> 00:41:13,119
...so I am not pushing you about the battle thing.

463
00:41:14,960 --> 00:41:17,759
You say the cloud does not cover the sun anymore.

464
00:41:18,600 --> 00:41:21,959
Hearts must be filled with joy.
Tell me. What is that good news?

465
00:41:23,200 --> 00:41:24,759
They could not say it yet.

466
00:41:25,160 --> 00:41:28,439
-Our Ulgen and..
-Cerkutay?

467
00:41:32,720 --> 00:41:34,039
Come on, Ulgen!

468
00:41:34,600 --> 00:41:37,279
Hang on! Do not die!

469
00:41:37,920 --> 00:41:40,199
Run! Faster!

470
00:41:40,680 --> 00:41:42,119
I am too tired

471
00:41:42,600 --> 00:41:45,839
-I cannot walk!
-Come on! You cannot give up!

472
00:41:46,000 --> 00:41:47,719
You cannot give up! Come on

473
00:41:51,200 --> 00:41:54,239
Len, didn't you just come from the battle?

474
00:41:55,800 --> 00:41:57,439
Go and have some rest!

475
00:41:57,760 --> 00:41:59,399
Why are you having fun with me?

476
00:41:59,400 --> 00:42:01,239
Fighting and battle is a wedding for us!

477
00:42:01,240 --> 00:42:04,879
Can't I make you run because
I fought a little with my swords?

478
00:42:05,040 --> 00:42:06,479
Come on Ulgen

479
00:42:06,760 --> 00:42:08,279
Len

480
00:42:09,280 --> 00:42:11,479
I have no power left! Enough

481
00:42:12,480 --> 00:42:14,999
That's not enough. You cannot give up!

482
00:42:16,280 --> 00:42:19,079
Your mother asked for your weight in gold.

483
00:42:19,480 --> 00:42:21,839
How can I find all that gold, Ulgen?

484
00:42:21,960 --> 00:42:25,919
At least let me eat a piece of bread.
You are making me run but I am starving!

485
00:42:25,920 --> 00:42:27,679
You will not eat!
You will not eat!

486
00:42:28,520 --> 00:42:29,799
You will not eat!

487
00:42:30,120 --> 00:42:32,359
You will lose weight...

488
00:42:32,480 --> 00:42:34,359
...until I find that gold.

489
00:42:34,720 --> 00:42:38,199
Enough! Enough!
What kind of a stingy man are you?

490
00:42:39,080 --> 00:42:40,679
I'm sorry.

491
00:42:42,840 --> 00:42:46,319
This apple would do no harm.

492
00:42:46,560 --> 00:42:48,639
No! No!

493
00:42:49,000 --> 00:42:51,319
-No! Ulgen...
-Cerkutay!

494
00:42:51,960 --> 00:42:53,919
-Give me my apple back.
-Ulgen...

495
00:42:54,080 --> 00:42:55,599
Once we are married...

496
00:42:55,640 --> 00:42:59,159
I will rain apples on you.

497
00:42:59,280 --> 00:43:02,159
Come on.
Come on Ulgen. Hang on.

498
00:43:02,320 --> 00:43:04,799
Come on. Come on.

499
00:43:05,160 --> 00:43:06,239
Come on

500
00:43:06,800 --> 00:43:08,839
Come on

501
00:43:09,440 --> 00:43:11,319
Come on

502
00:43:11,840 --> 00:43:14,359
Come on! Hurry!
Well done!

503
00:43:14,920 --> 00:43:16,239
Come on

504
00:43:17,840 --> 00:43:19,279
Well done, Ulgen

505
00:43:19,640 --> 00:43:22,479
-Faster! Go!
-Damn it.

506
00:43:22,560 --> 00:43:24,919
Come on, please! Come on

507
00:43:28,120 --> 00:43:29,239
Come on

508
00:43:31,040 --> 00:43:32,999
Allah..

509
00:43:38,160 --> 00:43:40,599
Come on! Faster!

510
00:43:43,880 --> 00:43:45,559
Allah... Allah..

511
00:43:46,520 --> 00:43:48,519
I'm alright.

512
00:43:54,680 --> 00:43:57,119
Come on! Come on

513
00:44:02,120 --> 00:44:05,399
He is going to starve me to death to give less gold.

514
00:44:07,320 --> 00:44:11,239
Pay it.
Bring us all that gold. I don't care.

515
00:44:12,720 --> 00:44:14,359
I will eat it now.

516
00:44:17,840 --> 00:44:19,799
Don't stop.

517
00:44:30,720 --> 00:44:32,239
Ulgen..

518
00:44:33,640 --> 00:44:36,599
Who is that man working for? For us!

519
00:44:38,960 --> 00:44:40,759
He keeps fighting..

520
00:44:41,200 --> 00:44:43,919
..and never has a rest.

521
00:44:44,800 --> 00:44:46,719
Alps!

522
00:44:50,040 --> 00:44:53,399
No, I won't eat it. I won't eat it.

523
00:44:59,160 --> 00:45:02,039
Marriage is such a hard thing! Off!

524
00:45:03,880 --> 00:45:06,279
Come on! Come on, Ulgen

525
00:45:10,200 --> 00:45:11,719
Come on! Faster!

526
00:45:12,320 --> 00:45:14,119
Run! Run

527
00:45:15,920 --> 00:45:18,519
-I arrived!
-Ulgen

528
00:45:21,440 --> 00:45:24,599
Come on... Ulgen...
Come on, one more time.

529
00:45:27,680 --> 00:45:31,119
Come on! The last time!

530
00:45:33,800 --> 00:45:35,239
Faster!

531
00:45:40,400 --> 00:45:42,679
Where is Cerkutay?
Hasn't he come yet?

532
00:45:42,880 --> 00:45:46,039
He is at the exercising place.
He is with Ulgen Hatun.

533
00:45:46,960 --> 00:45:49,839
May it be good brother.
Did they go to exercise?

534
00:45:50,400 --> 00:45:53,319
Yes. She is exercising.
The Dark Midwife...

535
00:45:53,680 --> 00:45:55,919
...asked for as much gold as
Ulgen Hatun's weight.

536
00:45:56,240 --> 00:45:58,359
He is trying to make her lose weight!

537
00:46:08,080 --> 00:46:10,199
Look, he is coming.

538
00:46:10,280 --> 00:46:12,479
I will not cut it..

539
00:46:12,560 --> 00:46:14,999
I swear it's for a good cause...

540
00:46:19,720 --> 00:46:21,079
Who are you talking to?

541
00:46:21,400 --> 00:46:24,159
-To Gurbuz.
-I wasn't even involved in the conversation!

542
00:46:24,360 --> 00:46:27,159
The name of the goat is Gurbuz.

543
00:46:39,440 --> 00:46:41,639
He really lost his mind.

544
00:46:41,760 --> 00:46:43,879
What did you do?

545
00:46:44,720 --> 00:46:46,479
What did you do?

546
00:46:47,720 --> 00:46:49,079
What can I do?

547
00:46:51,400 --> 00:46:53,039
What can I do?

548
00:46:54,280 --> 00:46:57,319
I found the goat.
Now I will go and talk to the Dark Midwife.

549
00:46:57,920 --> 00:47:00,039
Cerkutay... Brother...

550
00:47:00,480 --> 00:47:02,999
Do you think it is going to
happen with only a goat?

551
00:47:03,000 --> 00:47:06,159
- The Dark Midwife asked many things!
-What can I do?

552
00:47:06,240 --> 00:47:08,039
What can I do? How am I going to do it?

553
00:47:08,080 --> 00:47:11,799
The Dark Midwife
asks for so many things!

554
00:47:11,800 --> 00:47:14,959
What could I do? I did you a favor!

555
00:47:15,360 --> 00:47:19,239
If I hadn't talked to her, you would have
been crying in front of the kitchen.

556
00:47:21,520 --> 00:47:22,959
Cerkutay brother...

557
00:47:23,320 --> 00:47:26,039
What happened?
Couldn't you gather those things?

558
00:47:26,920 --> 00:47:30,479
How could I?
I just found the goat.

559
00:47:32,200 --> 00:47:33,999
Once I get married...

560
00:47:34,120 --> 00:47:37,759
...I will start collecting
the gold and build the house...

561
00:47:38,040 --> 00:47:40,879
The Dark Midwife will never accept that brother.

562
00:47:41,720 --> 00:47:43,199
She won't.

563
00:47:43,360 --> 00:47:45,799
Forget getting married before preparing...

564
00:47:46,280 --> 00:47:49,239
- ...what Dark Midwife asked for, brother.
-Forget it.

565
00:47:50,160 --> 00:47:53,039
How am I going to do it, brother?
I found this goat.

566
00:47:53,360 --> 00:47:56,399
How am I going to build that house?
Say I did it.

567
00:47:56,720 --> 00:47:59,879
How am I going to collect
Ulgen's weight in gold?

568
00:48:06,080 --> 00:48:07,439
Anyway.

569
00:48:09,920 --> 00:48:13,359
I will talk to the Dark Midwife first. Come on.

570
00:48:14,520 --> 00:48:16,759
Come out, Dark Midwife.

571
00:48:25,000 --> 00:48:26,199
Huseyin.

572
00:48:27,800 --> 00:48:31,119
Go and bring me two chests of gold. Come on.

573
00:48:34,000 --> 00:48:35,480
-My Bey..
-Yes?

574
00:48:35,690 --> 00:48:37,600
- Did you say gold?
- Yeah.

575
00:48:37,600 --> 00:48:38,639
Are you sure?

576
00:48:39,640 --> 00:48:42,599
Towba astagfurullah.
Go Huseyin. Go.

577
00:48:42,840 --> 00:48:44,399
-Go.
-My Bey...

578
00:48:44,880 --> 00:48:47,239
It won't come back.

579
00:48:47,920 --> 00:48:51,159
That Cerkutay will never be able to pay it back.

580
00:48:51,320 --> 00:48:55,359
Huseyin! I am still injured and it still hurts!

581
00:48:55,640 --> 00:48:58,039
Do not make me take my revenge from you!

582
00:49:02,520 --> 00:49:05,519
My Bey... Look, I'm going.

583
00:49:06,640 --> 00:49:09,039
Walk before I cut your head off.

584
00:49:14,560 --> 00:49:16,759
You have eyes like a hawk, my Osman.

585
00:49:17,760 --> 00:49:20,279
You deal with traitors inside and outside...

586
00:49:20,560 --> 00:49:23,359
...but you also know the wounds
in your Alps' hearts.

587
00:49:23,360 --> 00:49:25,319
We were also in love.

588
00:49:27,280 --> 00:49:28,119
Were?

589
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:32,079
-So it is in the past, huh, Osman Bey?
-No.

590
00:49:32,440 --> 00:49:35,079
-Did our love become old?
-No. How can that happen?

591
00:49:35,760 --> 00:49:37,079
Come here.

592
00:49:38,200 --> 00:49:40,479
Just like the very first day...

593
00:49:40,880 --> 00:49:42,799
..still like a knot.

594
00:49:46,920 --> 00:49:50,039
Look at me. Cerkutay, huh?

595
00:49:52,000 --> 00:49:53,719
So it's a good thing.

596
00:49:55,560 --> 00:49:58,959
Let's question him first.
Bride's house is always right.

597
00:50:00,080 --> 00:50:01,999
Right... We are always right.

598
00:50:02,120 --> 00:50:05,879
Right. You made me suffer many times!

599
00:50:15,760 --> 00:50:18,039
-Who's name is it?
-The goat's.

600
00:50:21,960 --> 00:50:26,239
Everyone heard of this goat in Yenisehir.

601
00:50:26,320 --> 00:50:28,159
You can ask around if you want to.

602
00:50:28,200 --> 00:50:32,039
So it's name is Gurbuz.

603
00:50:35,960 --> 00:50:39,599
Good, good.

604
00:50:44,280 --> 00:50:45,879
Where are the others?

605
00:50:49,120 --> 00:50:51,159
Dark Midwife...

606
00:50:53,680 --> 00:50:56,199
About that..

607
00:50:59,080 --> 00:51:01,199
The others..

608
00:51:01,600 --> 00:51:03,919
-After the council, I will..
-No way.

609
00:51:05,000 --> 00:51:08,279
Are you trying to trick me, lunatic boy?

610
00:51:14,440 --> 00:51:15,719
Dark Midwife.

611
00:51:16,680 --> 00:51:19,119
Let us find a way.

612
00:51:19,720 --> 00:51:21,799
Let's half the gold business.

613
00:51:27,960 --> 00:51:31,439
Sure, so that Cerkutay won't be in debt.

614
00:51:32,720 --> 00:51:33,999
No way.

615
00:51:34,360 --> 00:51:36,519
Do I want these golds for myself?

616
00:51:36,800 --> 00:51:38,959
I want it for my daughter.

617
00:51:47,680 --> 00:51:48,879
Dark Midwife.

618
00:51:50,440 --> 00:51:53,479
Don't you worry about this gold business.

619
00:51:54,560 --> 00:51:55,879
It is alright.

620
00:51:56,200 --> 00:51:59,759
I had a debt for my brother Cerkutay for a while.

621
00:52:00,440 --> 00:52:02,919
It is time to pay.

622
00:52:07,960 --> 00:52:09,879
Leave it near Gurbuz.

623
00:52:37,400 --> 00:52:40,199
Half of it is council gift.

624
00:52:40,840 --> 00:52:44,239
And the other is valiant Cerkutay's.

625
00:52:46,120 --> 00:52:47,919
Bayindir Bey.

626
00:52:56,240 --> 00:52:59,119
MashAllah.

627
00:53:02,440 --> 00:53:06,079
The gold business is done.

628
00:53:07,440 --> 00:53:10,279
Now, find a house..

629
00:53:11,200 --> 00:53:13,159
And come take my daughter.

630
00:53:30,320 --> 00:53:32,039
Cerkutay.

631
00:53:35,200 --> 00:53:36,359
Bey.

632
00:53:37,080 --> 00:53:38,399
What is happening here?

633
00:53:40,880 --> 00:53:42,639
What is happening

634
00:53:45,440 --> 00:53:47,719
Bey, I...I..

635
00:53:48,360 --> 00:53:50,399
I was going to inform you..

636
00:53:52,760 --> 00:53:55,879
However, you were..

637
00:53:56,280 --> 00:53:57,679
Quite busy..

638
00:53:57,880 --> 00:54:00,119
Stop it, stop it.

639
00:54:01,360 --> 00:54:02,279
Look at me.

640
00:54:03,800 --> 00:54:05,719
You want a girl.. In my mansion..

641
00:54:06,680 --> 00:54:08,359
In my house..

642
00:54:10,120 --> 00:54:12,599
Without asking me?

643
00:54:15,560 --> 00:54:16,839
Forgive me Bey.

644
00:54:17,640 --> 00:54:18,919
Tell me.

645
00:54:19,600 --> 00:54:20,879
Dark Midwife.

646
00:54:22,560 --> 00:54:26,119
No Bey, he hasn't yet.
He is just wandering around here.

647
00:54:27,400 --> 00:54:29,239
Bey, I haven't yet.

648
00:54:30,200 --> 00:54:31,999
Cerkutay.

649
00:54:35,480 --> 00:54:37,599
-You didn't give her to him right?
-No, Bey.

650
00:54:38,120 --> 00:54:41,079
She didn't.

651
00:54:48,120 --> 00:54:49,319
What do you want?

652
00:54:49,720 --> 00:54:52,639
Bey, I wanted gold and he provided.

653
00:54:53,920 --> 00:54:57,399
I wanted goat, and he provided as well.

654
00:54:57,840 --> 00:55:02,119
And I want a house for them to stay.

655
00:55:05,440 --> 00:55:06,599
The house is done.

656
00:55:08,600 --> 00:55:10,039
Let's get her.

657
00:55:18,240 --> 00:55:20,959
Now, Bey?
Now, now.

658
00:55:22,240 --> 00:55:25,119
Good business like this should be made hastily.

659
00:55:25,640 --> 00:55:26,759
Bey.

660
00:55:31,520 --> 00:55:34,159
-Cerkutay.
-Bey.

661
00:55:39,600 --> 00:55:43,079
And this was a business
that should've been dealt with for a while.

662
00:55:43,440 --> 00:55:46,919
And Osman Bey likes to
rush the good business like this.

663
00:55:47,880 --> 00:55:49,119
I do indeed.

664
00:55:50,840 --> 00:55:52,399
Come on then.

665
00:55:52,880 --> 00:55:54,679
Let us assemble the council.

666
00:55:54,760 --> 00:55:57,439
Alps, begin preparations.

667
00:56:28,800 --> 00:56:30,799
Valens' savages..

668
00:56:31,080 --> 00:56:33,559
They will kill everyone
who supports Osman.

669
00:56:34,000 --> 00:56:36,679
They will kill Osman's commanders.

670
00:56:41,960 --> 00:56:45,239
However, the real war is different.

671
00:56:51,360 --> 00:56:53,839
My army will prepare for it.

672
00:56:54,480 --> 00:56:56,879
We will be together..

673
00:56:57,120 --> 00:56:59,399
With the upcoming army of Valens..

674
00:57:13,440 --> 00:57:15,559
The armies will unite.

675
00:57:15,680 --> 00:57:17,879
There will be two mountains.

676
00:57:18,040 --> 00:57:21,799
And Osman will be crushed
between those two mountains.

677
00:57:23,400 --> 00:57:26,639
I will destroy all Osman's lands.

678
00:57:27,680 --> 00:57:30,919
And in the end, Konya.

679
00:57:41,480 --> 00:57:43,119
Are you afraid?

680
00:57:44,400 --> 00:57:47,119
I am not, Grand Commander Nayman.

681
00:57:48,200 --> 00:57:52,119
The death is far from us when
under your service.

682
00:58:01,480 --> 00:58:03,999
Those who will die are different.

683
00:58:04,360 --> 00:58:07,919
Konya, Yenisehir, Sogut..

684
00:58:08,200 --> 00:58:10,679
All Turkmens..

685
00:58:13,360 --> 00:58:15,959
Will be destroyed..

686
00:58:16,040 --> 00:58:19,119
When my army unites with Lord's.

687
00:58:22,320 --> 00:58:25,599
Tendu, train the nokers well.

688
00:58:27,080 --> 00:58:29,079
My army will be very strong..

689
00:58:29,240 --> 00:58:31,079
In the grand war.

690
00:58:31,360 --> 00:58:32,519
Quickly.

691
00:58:49,800 --> 00:58:52,639
Here are our golds.

692
00:58:55,080 --> 00:58:56,999
The house is a promise of mine.

693
00:59:02,680 --> 00:59:05,599
Alps will build a great house for them..

694
00:59:05,720 --> 00:59:07,959
At the most beautiful place in Yenisehir.

695
00:59:08,440 --> 00:59:12,639
InshAllah.

696
00:59:20,560 --> 00:59:23,199
Until then, they will live in the mansion.

697
00:59:27,800 --> 00:59:30,279
And our goat is here.

698
00:59:34,240 --> 00:59:36,439
To cut it shortly..

699
00:59:36,800 --> 00:59:39,879
With the command of Allah,
with the words of the prophet..

700
00:59:41,160 --> 00:59:43,199
We want our girl Ulgen..

701
00:59:45,800 --> 00:59:48,159
To my alp Cerkutay.

702
00:59:59,920 --> 01:00:00,919
Ulgen.

703
01:00:03,920 --> 01:00:06,159
Do you have consent to this?

704
01:00:10,080 --> 01:00:11,639
Yes, mother.

705
01:00:14,560 --> 01:00:15,719
Then..

706
01:00:16,280 --> 01:00:18,719
They fell in love.

707
01:00:20,680 --> 01:00:23,439
Our respect to love is infinite.

708
01:00:25,840 --> 01:00:28,599
I know Cerkutay,
I've observed him since I came here.

709
01:00:28,920 --> 01:00:31,999
He is a man of his words.

710
01:00:36,160 --> 01:00:38,919
However, Cerkutay..

711
01:00:39,520 --> 01:00:41,679
You will give me a promise.

712
01:00:43,920 --> 01:00:45,439
You will take..

713
01:00:48,160 --> 01:00:50,119
Good care of my daughter.

714
01:01:04,560 --> 01:01:07,799
You can trust me.

715
01:01:14,960 --> 01:01:18,039
Congratulations, brother.

716
01:01:22,280 --> 01:01:23,679
Ulgen.

717
01:01:25,080 --> 01:01:27,599
It is hard to be a wife of an alp.

718
01:01:31,480 --> 01:01:33,559
Do you have consent to this burden?

719
01:01:35,200 --> 01:01:37,079
am, mother.

720
01:01:38,720 --> 01:01:39,599
Good.

721
01:01:43,360 --> 01:01:45,839
I trust you with Cerkutay as well.

722
01:01:46,560 --> 01:01:49,079
You will take good care of him.

723
01:01:49,480 --> 01:01:50,919
I will, mother.

724
01:01:53,960 --> 01:01:55,279
Congratulations.

725
01:01:59,920 --> 01:02:02,759
Then, I'll allow it.

726
01:02:02,960 --> 01:02:04,319
Let it be mubarak.

727
01:02:04,520 --> 01:02:06,639
-Praise be!
-Congratulations.

728
01:02:11,640 --> 01:02:13,399
We have council this night.

729
01:02:13,920 --> 01:02:16,159
May the preparations begin quickly.

730
01:02:23,880 --> 01:02:27,719
Osman Bey, how will this happen
with all these dangers going on?

731
01:02:28,120 --> 01:02:31,759
And we don't know what Lord Valens will do.

732
01:02:32,440 --> 01:02:34,879
That's how it is in these lands, Eskigun.

733
01:02:36,440 --> 01:02:38,599
Our weddings, our celebrations..

734
01:02:39,040 --> 01:02:41,679
Are all done while fighting with infidels.

735
01:02:41,720 --> 01:02:44,479
And, fighting is wedding to a Turk.

736
01:02:46,840 --> 01:02:48,639
Cerkutay.

737
01:02:52,320 --> 01:02:53,519
Brother..

738
01:03:05,040 --> 01:03:06,479
My Commanders...

739
01:03:07,160 --> 01:03:08,479
You..

740
01:03:09,040 --> 01:03:13,039
...will welcome the vanguards
that will arrive in KartalGozu.

741
01:03:16,440 --> 01:03:18,639
This vanguard..

742
01:03:18,840 --> 01:03:22,119
...has the strongest soldiers you can ever see.

743
01:03:24,840 --> 01:03:26,959
Each one is wilder than the other.

744
01:03:27,560 --> 01:03:29,719
Those who were created to fight.

745
01:03:33,120 --> 01:03:34,719
Osman..

746
01:03:36,800 --> 01:03:38,519
..tried to..

747
01:03:39,200 --> 01:03:40,679
..kill you..

748
01:03:41,520 --> 01:03:44,239
...my commanders and my consul brothers.

749
01:03:46,560 --> 01:03:50,119
The main purpose of this incoming vanguard...

750
01:03:53,760 --> 01:03:56,639
...will be to destroy Osman's commanders...

751
01:03:57,200 --> 01:03:59,679
...and Beys.

752
01:04:00,800 --> 01:04:03,719
Osman must have taken a precaution against this.

753
01:04:03,760 --> 01:04:05,719
He knows that an army is coming.

754
01:04:08,920 --> 01:04:10,439
No doubt.

755
01:04:11,200 --> 01:04:14,519
He must be waiting for us
like a deer with its ears pricked up.

756
01:04:16,800 --> 01:04:19,119
He built a wall of flesh everywhere...

757
01:04:19,760 --> 01:04:22,319
..for his dear folk.

758
01:04:22,600 --> 01:04:24,079
But he doesn't know..

759
01:04:24,640 --> 01:04:27,679
...that those who come are the biggest of the hunters.

760
01:04:28,240 --> 01:04:31,679
Osman will do his best to
prevent this vanguard from coming.

761
01:04:32,160 --> 01:04:34,239
What is our duty, Valens?

762
01:04:34,520 --> 01:04:37,919
We will not make a mistake and underestimate Osman.

763
01:04:38,280 --> 01:04:42,559
We will ensure that
the vanguard arrives safely on our lands.

764
01:04:45,480 --> 01:04:46,799
They will come..

765
01:04:47,400 --> 01:04:50,919
...and I will make them die the worst way.

766
01:05:01,720 --> 01:05:05,239
Sir.. Forgive me, but there is important news.

767
01:05:07,080 --> 01:05:10,039
They encountered Osman' Alps around KartalGozu.

768
01:05:12,040 --> 01:05:13,519
They ran away.

769
01:05:42,840 --> 01:05:44,599
As you can see..

770
01:05:45,280 --> 01:05:47,359
...Osman never stops!

771
01:05:50,080 --> 01:05:53,639
He is watching us like a deer trying to see the hunter!

772
01:06:19,760 --> 01:06:21,239
My Cerkutay...

773
01:06:23,040 --> 01:06:25,799
Are you excited because of the wedding, brother?

774
01:06:27,240 --> 01:06:28,679
Yes, brother.

775
01:06:33,080 --> 01:06:35,999
We could not shoot the Commanders
or the consul...

776
01:06:37,880 --> 01:06:40,559
...and the army is at the door
on western front.

777
01:06:46,360 --> 01:06:48,639
Why are you worried about that, Cerkutay?

778
01:06:49,120 --> 01:06:51,719
Didn't my Bey say that it works like that in here?

779
01:06:51,840 --> 01:06:54,319
Infidels and ceremonies will always be here.

780
01:06:54,640 --> 01:06:56,519
Cerkutay...

781
01:06:59,360 --> 01:07:01,919
...don't you hear your Bey, huh?

782
01:07:03,760 --> 01:07:06,599
Or is it a gift for you not to hear?

783
01:07:09,840 --> 01:07:11,279
No way, my Bey.

784
01:07:13,320 --> 01:07:16,039
During these hard days... I rushed.

785
01:07:16,520 --> 01:07:19,599
-The army is at the door.
-Stop there.

786
01:07:20,000 --> 01:07:21,999
Stop. Konur is right.

787
01:07:22,520 --> 01:07:25,119
We can fight and organize a wedding

788
01:07:27,400 --> 01:07:29,199
Let's hold that wedding first.

789
01:07:29,600 --> 01:07:32,199
Don't worry.
Alps are watching the way anyway.

790
01:07:35,480 --> 01:07:36,959
My Bey, can I come in?

791
01:07:38,680 --> 01:07:39,999
Come in Samil.

792
01:07:41,800 --> 01:07:45,119
My Bey. We received news from our watchmen.

793
01:07:45,600 --> 01:07:49,119
The armies stopped. But a vanguard is setting out.

794
01:07:51,240 --> 01:07:54,439
Alps seemed bad when talking about the vanguard, my Bey.

795
01:07:54,680 --> 01:07:57,799
They say they are the most talented warriors of west.

796
01:08:00,240 --> 01:08:03,279
One of them worths ten men. Their armous...

797
01:08:03,560 --> 01:08:06,799
...their swords, their talents are all special.

798
01:08:06,920 --> 01:08:10,119
Special huh? Then..

799
01:08:10,560 --> 01:08:12,999
...we will bury them in the most beautiful...

800
01:08:13,320 --> 01:08:16,038
...place of our land with our special swords.

801
01:08:19,640 --> 01:08:21,118
So that they are coming..

802
01:08:21,960 --> 01:08:23,919
...then they will learn a lesson.

803
01:08:26,760 --> 01:08:28,038
Now..

804
01:08:28,200 --> 01:08:29,919
...where will the army come from?

805
01:08:29,920 --> 01:08:32,038
Where will it stop? Where will it settle?

806
01:08:32,479 --> 01:08:33,879
You will know all of them.

807
01:08:34,479 --> 01:08:36,559
-Yes my Bey.
-Yes my Bey.

808
01:08:39,439 --> 01:08:42,118
-My Bey...
-This is not about today.

809
01:08:44,920 --> 01:08:47,719
We will take our precaution and continue.

810
01:08:48,200 --> 01:08:49,959
Don't worry.

811
01:08:54,160 --> 01:08:55,359
Here..

812
01:08:57,399 --> 01:08:59,158
This is my wedding gift for you.

813
01:09:22,080 --> 01:09:22,759
My Bey...

814
01:09:27,240 --> 01:09:30,759
-My Bey, thank you.
-Cerkutay... Cerkutay...

815
01:09:34,560 --> 01:09:37,238
Come on now. The bride's house always says no first.

816
01:09:37,680 --> 01:09:39,479
But groom's house is always ready.

817
01:09:40,680 --> 01:09:43,999
Come on now. There is a ceremony to attend.

818
01:09:57,080 --> 01:09:58,439
Lords!

819
01:09:58,920 --> 01:10:02,439
This isn't a game, but a war!

820
01:10:02,880 --> 01:10:06,559
And I'll decide who will win and lose!

821
01:10:08,560 --> 01:10:10,999
Osman knows about the vanguard!

822
01:10:11,120 --> 01:10:14,439
And he will do his best to stop them.

823
01:10:14,680 --> 01:10:17,519
If the vanguard is strong as you said,

824
01:10:18,160 --> 01:10:21,799
...you shouldn't be afraid. They won't fail.

825
01:10:23,720 --> 01:10:25,599
They may not.

826
01:10:26,720 --> 01:10:30,319
Then what are you for, Lord?

827
01:10:33,000 --> 01:10:35,839
I'd rather go back to my castle and take measures.

828
01:10:40,360 --> 01:10:43,479
Are you afraid of a wounded wolf?

829
01:10:44,440 --> 01:10:46,759
I don't like cowards.

830
01:10:47,800 --> 01:10:51,079
We're the ones to choke him.

831
01:10:57,640 --> 01:10:59,359
The vanguard..

832
01:10:59,680 --> 01:11:02,879
...will use the route that we all know well.

833
01:11:07,640 --> 01:11:10,919
So everyone will stay here.

834
01:11:11,360 --> 01:11:12,919
We will talk.

835
01:11:15,200 --> 01:11:19,519
If Osman is watching us instead of taking measures,

836
01:11:20,440 --> 01:11:23,519
...then we can choose what he's going to see.

837
01:11:27,000 --> 01:11:29,199
You're tired. Get some rest.

838
01:11:30,560 --> 01:11:35,279
By the morning, I'll have drawn the picture
that Osman is going to see.

839
01:11:38,440 --> 01:11:40,359
Have a nice rest.

840
01:11:46,040 --> 01:11:48,479
I said have a nice rest!

841
01:11:56,200 --> 01:11:59,119
Look at the bride.

842
01:11:59,320 --> 01:12:02,319
She has henna on her hands.

843
01:12:02,480 --> 01:12:05,639
Don't say anything to the bride.

844
01:12:05,640 --> 01:12:08,719
She may take offense and go back home.

845
01:12:08,960 --> 01:12:11,919
Her door is hennaed.

846
01:12:12,080 --> 01:12:15,159
She has an angel-like nature.

847
01:12:15,280 --> 01:12:18,399
May your bride-henna be holy.

848
01:12:18,560 --> 01:12:21,999
May you be happy in your tent.

849
01:12:22,160 --> 01:12:25,039
Look at the bride.

850
01:12:25,200 --> 01:12:27,999
She has henna on her hands.

851
01:12:28,080 --> 01:12:30,959
Don't say anything to the bride.

852
01:12:31,160 --> 01:12:34,039
She may take offense and go back home.

853
01:12:34,280 --> 01:12:36,999
Her door is hennaed.

854
01:12:37,240 --> 01:12:40,199
She has an angel-like nature.

855
01:12:40,360 --> 01:12:43,039
May your bride-henna be holy.

856
01:12:43,200 --> 01:12:46,159
May you be happy in your tent.

857
01:12:47,920 --> 01:12:50,959
-May Allah bless it.
-Thanks.

858
01:12:53,440 --> 01:12:56,279
May Allah give you a bright future.

859
01:12:56,520 --> 01:12:57,999
Amen, mother.

860
01:12:58,280 --> 01:13:00,799
-Amen.
-Amen.

861
01:13:03,360 --> 01:13:06,439
My beauty, let's apply henna on you too.

862
01:13:06,840 --> 01:13:10,119
You should. She's a big sister now.

863
01:13:10,480 --> 01:13:13,599
I don't want. I'm just Halime's sister.

864
01:13:13,680 --> 01:13:16,159
I won't sister anyone else.

865
01:13:17,560 --> 01:13:19,559
Why is that, Fatma?

866
01:13:20,800 --> 01:13:24,599
If I sister someone else, my sister will be upset.

867
01:13:32,120 --> 01:13:36,039
Fatma, are you afraid that you will lose favor?

868
01:13:36,240 --> 01:13:37,519
You should be.

869
01:13:37,640 --> 01:13:39,399
Another baby is coming.

870
01:13:39,400 --> 01:13:42,319
Both you and Halime will lose favor.

871
01:13:51,640 --> 01:13:53,559
Not at all.

872
01:13:55,240 --> 01:13:58,719
Come on, hatuns.
They're waiting for us. Let's go.

873
01:14:03,800 --> 01:14:09,559
-Do you?
-I do.

874
01:14:10,840 --> 01:14:12,639
Do you?

875
01:14:14,200 --> 01:14:15,679
I do.

876
01:14:21,560 --> 01:14:24,959
Ulgen Hatun. Do you take...

877
01:14:25,400 --> 01:14:28,959
...Cerkutay to be your husband?

878
01:14:30,640 --> 01:14:31,639
I do.

879
01:14:32,040 --> 01:14:34,799
-Do you?
-I do.

880
01:14:35,840 --> 01:14:38,879
-Do you?
-I do.

881
01:14:45,080 --> 01:14:46,879
Witnesses.

882
01:14:47,280 --> 01:14:49,559
Do you witness?

883
01:14:49,720 --> 01:14:52,799
We do.
We do.

884
01:14:56,720 --> 01:15:00,999
-May Allah bless your marriage.
-Amen!

885
01:15:08,760 --> 01:15:14,279
We seek refuge in Allah from the accursed Satan.
In the name of Allah, the merciful, the compassionate.

886
01:15:32,240 --> 01:15:35,159
-Come on then
-In the name of Allah.

887
01:15:42,560 --> 01:15:44,799
-Brother.
-My Bey.

888
01:15:49,360 --> 01:15:51,999
Congratulations.

889
01:15:57,120 --> 01:16:00,119
-Congratulations.
-Thanks, my Bey.

890
01:16:25,520 --> 01:16:27,879
We gave a girl to a Mongolian.

891
01:16:28,360 --> 01:16:32,679
Now it's time to take a girl
from a Mongolian.

892
01:16:32,880 --> 01:16:35,439
Right, Esrigun Hatun?

893
01:16:45,560 --> 01:16:48,159
Do you have someone in your heart?

894
01:16:54,720 --> 01:16:56,439
No, Dark Midwife.

895
01:16:57,080 --> 01:16:59,599
I have nothing else but my sword in my heart.

896
01:17:00,400 --> 01:17:02,399
You will.

897
01:17:03,160 --> 01:17:06,439
You can never be sure about heart affairs.

898
01:17:10,000 --> 01:17:12,399
Right, Boran Alp?

899
01:17:18,800 --> 01:17:20,039
Alps!

900
01:17:20,160 --> 01:17:22,639
Now it's your turn

901
01:17:23,000 --> 01:17:25,119
I'll keep an eye on you.

902
01:17:26,120 --> 01:17:28,359
No more single days!

903
01:17:29,200 --> 01:17:31,439
I will make you all get married

904
01:17:42,760 --> 01:17:45,119
Do I have permission, Osman Bey?

905
01:17:45,400 --> 01:17:47,359
You have it.

906
01:17:47,800 --> 01:17:51,559
We're ready to have the wedding whenever you like.

907
01:17:57,600 --> 01:17:59,359
Osman Bey.

908
01:17:59,600 --> 01:18:02,239
It's Bayindir Bey's turn.

909
01:18:02,680 --> 01:18:04,679
No way

910
01:18:06,360 --> 01:18:08,879
It's brother Boran's turn

911
01:18:09,520 --> 01:18:11,599
Not at all, Bayindir Bey.

912
01:18:12,840 --> 01:18:14,839
It's brother Onur's turn.

913
01:18:16,880 --> 01:18:19,119
Stop fighting

914
01:18:19,520 --> 01:18:21,799
I will make everyone of you get married!

915
01:18:33,680 --> 01:18:35,239
Alps!

916
01:18:35,600 --> 01:18:37,519
Draw your swords!

917
01:18:37,760 --> 01:18:39,919
-As my Bey orders!
-As my Bey orders!

918
01:18:40,120 --> 01:18:42,879
-As you order, my Bey!
-Cheer it up!

919
01:18:46,720 --> 01:18:48,679
Come on, brothers!

920
01:20:13,880 --> 01:20:16,959
What did Cerkutay Alp do?

921
01:20:17,200 --> 01:20:19,919
He ate, he drank and he fought.

922
01:20:20,000 --> 01:20:23,079
What did he do for Ulgen Hatun?

923
01:20:23,360 --> 01:20:27,279
He brought the biggest goat of Yenisehir.

924
01:20:27,320 --> 01:20:29,359
What else did he do?

925
01:20:29,480 --> 01:20:33,399
He ate foods, he made her eat and drink.

926
01:20:35,960 --> 01:20:39,079
What else did he do?

927
01:20:39,240 --> 01:20:42,199
He brought gold equal to her weight!

928
01:20:42,280 --> 01:20:44,959
And he was beaten by a stick.

929
01:22:31,160 --> 01:22:34,439
Commander Nayman is sleeping,
go back to your duties.

930
01:24:27,760 --> 01:24:29,959
The one who tries to kill Nayman

931
01:24:30,960 --> 01:24:33,239
who was blessed by Gok Teng

932
01:24:33,600 --> 01:24:36,039
will suffer the wrath of Erlik Han.

933
01:24:36,560 --> 01:24:39,959
Esrigun sent you.

934
01:24:47,120 --> 01:24:50,319
You will be her death warrant.

935
01:24:51,640 --> 01:24:55,639
Forgive me, forgive me great Nayman.

936
01:25:11,440 --> 01:25:13,799
My spy Ayceren is the closest one to Nayman.

937
01:25:14,640 --> 01:25:15,959
I will take the seal.

938
01:25:16,760 --> 01:25:19,239
Nayman cannot do anything without the seal.

939
01:25:20,040 --> 01:25:23,359
He can only wait for the day
that he will lose his head.

940
01:25:24,640 --> 01:25:25,919
Esrigun Hatun.

941
01:25:26,680 --> 01:25:29,399
-Do you think she can handle it?
-She will.

942
01:25:30,000 --> 01:25:33,719
Otherwise it will be too hard for us to defeat Nayman.

943
01:25:34,840 --> 01:25:38,319
-When will she bring the seal?
-She'll bring it tomorrow, InshaAllah.

944
01:25:39,680 --> 01:25:42,119
EyvAllah. EyvAllah.

945
01:25:42,920 --> 01:25:44,519
But it is dangerous.

946
01:25:44,960 --> 01:25:46,839
You are Gazan Khan's trust to us.

947
01:25:47,880 --> 01:25:49,679
We cannot let you go alone.

948
01:25:51,040 --> 01:25:53,559
Boran is my right hand man.

949
01:25:55,560 --> 01:25:57,439
She will be with you in this case.

950
01:26:04,840 --> 01:26:07,119
I can handle it alone, Osman Bey.

951
01:26:07,440 --> 01:26:10,159
-Thank you.
-For you to survive

952
01:26:11,640 --> 01:26:14,039
Boran will be with you in this case.

953
01:26:15,800 --> 01:26:17,439
Yes my Bey.

954
01:26:18,240 --> 01:26:20,679
I'll keep an eye on your trust, my Bey.

955
01:26:37,280 --> 01:26:39,439
My Sultans are here.

956
01:26:39,520 --> 01:26:42,639
Come here now, come here.

957
01:26:43,520 --> 01:26:45,079
If you'll excuse me, Osman Bey.

958
01:26:45,440 --> 01:26:47,239
Of course.

959
01:26:52,200 --> 01:26:53,399
Boran.

960
01:26:59,720 --> 01:27:01,919
Come here now.

961
01:27:04,480 --> 01:27:06,919
Father, don't you miss us?

962
01:27:07,200 --> 01:27:08,719
Of course I do.

963
01:27:09,080 --> 01:27:13,479
I feel pain at the tip of my nose

964
01:27:14,000 --> 01:27:15,479
whenever I don't see you.

965
01:27:15,640 --> 01:27:19,039
You say so, but you always take
my brothers to the battle.

966
01:27:19,120 --> 01:27:20,639
You don't take us at all.

967
01:27:25,360 --> 01:27:29,359
My beautiful daughter, look Halime cannot walk yet.

968
01:27:29,760 --> 01:27:32,959
So you need to help her, take care of her.

969
01:27:33,520 --> 01:27:36,119
Let's do it that way for now. But,

970
01:27:36,440 --> 01:27:40,639
if you don't take us there when
my sister grows up, you'll see the consequences.

971
01:27:43,200 --> 01:27:44,679
Don't you worry.

972
01:27:45,640 --> 01:27:47,319
Just grow up

973
01:27:47,480 --> 01:27:50,639
then you will go everywhere I go.

974
01:27:52,120 --> 01:27:54,799
Father, everyone says something about my shoes

975
01:27:54,880 --> 01:27:56,799
-They say that...
-Fatma.

976
01:27:57,160 --> 01:27:59,919
My beautiful daughter, your father needs to work.

977
01:27:59,960 --> 01:28:01,759
Come on, let's put Halime to sleep.

978
01:28:02,120 --> 01:28:05,639
I'll take her to the bed, no one but her can understand me now.

979
01:28:06,800 --> 01:28:09,959
Of course not, where are you leaving?
Hang on.

980
01:28:10,360 --> 01:28:13,479
No one can rule you out.

981
01:28:20,520 --> 01:28:22,719
Let me tell you a tale.

982
01:28:27,920 --> 01:28:29,679
My sweethearts.

983
01:28:53,560 --> 01:28:55,879
There are those

984
01:28:56,840 --> 01:28:58,999
who would die for their loved ones.

985
01:29:13,040 --> 01:29:14,399
Ulgen.

986
01:29:25,720 --> 01:29:28,119
My Ulgen.

987
01:29:29,640 --> 01:29:32,119
There are those...

988
01:29:33,280 --> 01:29:35,239
...who would die for their loved ones.

989
01:29:45,360 --> 01:29:47,999
-He goes...
-I said my Ulgen!

990
01:29:54,360 --> 01:29:55,919
Cerkutay?

991
01:29:57,160 --> 01:29:58,359
Ulgen.

992
01:29:59,720 --> 01:30:02,439
Ulgen, I understand you.

993
01:30:05,280 --> 01:30:08,239
But stop. You'll be chocked up.

994
01:30:08,280 --> 01:30:10,519
Nothing will happen. I'll eat it.
-Wait, Ulgen.

995
01:30:10,520 --> 01:30:11,839
Wait, you'll be chocked up.

996
01:30:12,120 --> 01:30:14,519
Ulgen stop, Ulgen stop.

997
01:30:18,000 --> 01:30:20,039
Look at them.

998
01:30:23,120 --> 01:30:24,799
Will you eat them all?

999
01:30:24,960 --> 01:30:26,919
You ate your share. These are mine.

1000
01:30:27,320 --> 01:30:29,199
-All of them?
-All of them!

1001
01:30:29,440 --> 01:30:31,799
You heard about the gold equal to my weight,

1002
01:30:32,040 --> 01:30:34,559
you didn't let me eat anything.

1003
01:30:35,760 --> 01:30:37,559
These are mine now.

1004
01:30:40,520 --> 01:30:42,599
You were so hungry, is that so?

1005
01:30:42,680 --> 01:30:46,359
You left me hungry.
For the sake of gold,

1006
01:30:46,680 --> 01:30:49,279
you left me hungry,
don't you feel any guilt?

1007
01:30:50,080 --> 01:30:53,519
-Ulgen, don't.
-I'll do so.

1008
01:30:53,680 --> 01:30:55,719
-Cerkutay!
-You'll blow up!

1009
01:30:55,760 --> 01:30:58,639
I'm saying for your own sake.
No eating, give it to me.

1010
01:30:58,720 --> 01:31:02,559
Ulgen, give it to me. That's enough!

1011
01:31:02,560 --> 01:31:05,479
-No.
-Did I do this to you?

1012
01:31:07,720 --> 01:31:10,799
Do you make my daughter starve on the first day?

1013
01:31:12,960 --> 01:31:15,159
No, no mother.

1014
01:31:17,360 --> 01:31:20,279
No mother. How could that be.

1015
01:31:22,560 --> 01:31:24,999
Mother, stop

1016
01:31:25,040 --> 01:31:28,599
-It's not like that.
-What? I heard it all.

1017
01:31:29,200 --> 01:31:32,919
Mother, don't be mad,
Cerkutay looks after me well.

1018
01:31:34,600 --> 01:31:36,239
-You sure?
-I am sure.

1019
01:31:36,440 --> 01:31:39,559
Look at me, if he acts bad to you..

1020
01:31:40,040 --> 01:31:42,559
-Mother.
-Mother, what are you saying?

1021
01:31:42,880 --> 01:31:46,759
I look after my Ulgen well.

1022
01:31:48,720 --> 01:31:49,679
Even..

1023
01:31:51,440 --> 01:31:53,079
I brought him flow..

1024
01:32:00,920 --> 01:32:03,349
Lan! (Turkish slang word for"son!")
Lunatic Boy!

1025
01:32:03,449 --> 01:32:06,319
Do you bring grass to my daughter?

1026
01:32:06,600 --> 01:32:09,079
Do you make fun of my daughter?

1027
01:32:17,840 --> 01:32:21,619
Lan Gurbuz!
What did you do to the flowers?

1028
01:32:26,440 --> 01:32:29,879
Let it go, its not his fault.

1029
01:32:29,960 --> 01:32:32,279
Come my Gurbuz.

1030
01:32:32,360 --> 01:32:34,879
My goat, my Gurbuz.

1031
01:32:34,920 --> 01:32:36,919
My Gurbuz.

1032
01:32:38,320 --> 01:32:40,039
Lan Gurbuz..

1033
01:32:41,240 --> 01:32:43,079
Ah, Gurbuz..

1034
01:32:45,640 --> 01:32:49,159
Quickly now brother, quickly.
I came to pick you up.

1035
01:32:49,880 --> 01:32:53,039
I was not talking about you,
I was talking about Gurbuz.

1036
01:32:53,200 --> 01:32:54,519
What are you saying?

1037
01:32:55,480 --> 01:32:58,239
Cerkutay, Osman Bey is about to be here!

1038
01:32:58,440 --> 01:33:00,919
Quickly, to Sogut, follow me.

1039
01:33:03,680 --> 01:33:06,679
All Gurbuzs are the same.

1040
01:33:10,240 --> 01:33:12,039
I am leaving now.

1041
01:33:13,360 --> 01:33:16,719
However, you should know that..

1042
01:33:17,880 --> 01:33:22,159
I will not die from a sword wound
I will die from your mother's staff.

1043
01:33:24,000 --> 01:33:25,599
She can kill for sure.

1044
01:33:26,520 --> 01:33:29,559
Her staff is very popular
around the whole world.

1045
01:33:29,840 --> 01:33:31,839
Look here, I did not tell my mother.

1046
01:33:32,080 --> 01:33:35,399
Thus saving you from a head wound.

1047
01:33:35,640 --> 01:33:38,359
From now on, I am the most precious.

1048
01:34:05,400 --> 01:34:07,279
Am I full?

1049
01:34:08,240 --> 01:34:09,439
I am not full.

1050
01:34:32,880 --> 01:34:36,159
-Peace be upon you, brothers.
-Peace be upon you too.

1051
01:34:36,320 --> 01:34:37,799
Peace be upon you too.

1052
01:34:38,520 --> 01:34:41,799
Beys have arrived at Sogut,
they wait for Osman Bey.

1053
01:34:43,600 --> 01:34:45,679
Let's be ready quickly, brothers.

1054
01:34:49,320 --> 01:34:50,399
Sahin..

1055
01:34:50,840 --> 01:34:53,159
When will the scouts allow for taking land?

1056
01:34:53,440 --> 01:34:55,399
The scouts are after it, brother.

1057
01:34:55,800 --> 01:34:57,599
We will learn, inshAllah.

1058
01:34:58,680 --> 01:35:01,839
Now, the important thing
is not when they will arrive.

1059
01:35:01,840 --> 01:35:04,079
It is how Osman Bey will stop them.

1060
01:35:04,800 --> 01:35:07,639
My Bey promise them a place beneath the dirt.

1061
01:35:07,840 --> 01:35:10,359
-You are right.
-He must have a move.

1062
01:35:11,720 --> 01:35:14,119
So that's why all those Beys gathered in Sogut.

1063
01:35:15,680 --> 01:35:18,039
We will soon learn about our goal.

1064
01:35:18,520 --> 01:35:21,759
Until then, we need to wait patiently.

1065
01:35:22,600 --> 01:35:25,559
-Yes brother.
-Yes brother.

1066
01:35:26,560 --> 01:35:28,639
Quickly, Bey is waiting for us.

1067
01:35:47,240 --> 01:35:49,439
Don't do this Grand Commander Nayman.

1068
01:35:50,480 --> 01:35:53,439
If you let me go, if you show mercy..

1069
01:35:54,200 --> 01:35:56,559
Ghazan Khan will forgive you.

1070
01:35:59,640 --> 01:36:02,959
-Where did you find it?
-I find it on her.

1071
01:36:04,400 --> 01:36:06,239
The map of their meeting place.

1072
01:36:11,720 --> 01:36:14,399
All of the places, except one.

1073
01:36:22,640 --> 01:36:26,199
Ayceren... Esrigul...

1074
01:36:26,280 --> 01:36:28,799
While your owner is waiting to get the seal..

1075
01:36:28,880 --> 01:36:32,839
He will lose his life.

1076
01:37:04,280 --> 01:37:05,959
Welcome, Osman Bey.

1077
01:37:06,960 --> 01:37:08,599
Thank you.

1078
01:37:10,800 --> 01:37:12,599
Thank you.

1079
01:37:13,800 --> 01:37:15,599
Thank you.

1080
01:37:19,160 --> 01:37:21,039
May Allah's blessing upon you.

1081
01:37:21,800 --> 01:37:23,519
May Allah's blessing upon you.

1082
01:37:37,800 --> 01:37:40,799
Look sister, now they are after our shoes.

1083
01:37:41,080 --> 01:37:43,879
They will throw our shoes
to do roof, or they say.

1084
01:37:44,360 --> 01:37:47,839
I will not allow it of course. Look,
I carry them with me.

1085
01:37:52,440 --> 01:37:55,079
Now, I will teach them such a lesson that..

1086
01:37:55,280 --> 01:37:57,079
They will love us the most.

1087
01:37:57,440 --> 01:38:00,239
And those babies will see!

1088
01:38:00,480 --> 01:38:02,999
I did it before and it worked.

1089
01:38:03,240 --> 01:38:07,039
Now I will do it again.
Come on sister, let's go to our tribe.

1090
01:38:08,240 --> 01:38:10,639
Parents are at council, no one can see us.

1091
01:38:11,360 --> 01:38:13,679
Don't you cry though.

1092
01:38:14,240 --> 01:38:15,159
Come on.

1093
01:38:43,080 --> 01:38:46,319
- Peace be upon you.
- Peace be upon you too.

1094
01:38:51,760 --> 01:38:53,239
You may sit.

1095
01:39:04,120 --> 01:39:05,999
I am opening the council..

1096
01:39:07,600 --> 01:39:10,599
In the name of Allah and
His ninety nine names..

1097
01:39:11,360 --> 01:39:14,279
Making us responsible for not victory..

1098
01:39:15,120 --> 01:39:16,439
But the campaign.

1099
01:39:18,120 --> 01:39:21,119
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

1100
01:39:21,480 --> 01:39:23,719
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

1101
01:39:29,240 --> 01:39:31,439
Lord Valens.

1102
01:39:35,200 --> 01:39:38,559
We couldn't stop the army
he sent from the west...

1103
01:39:39,640 --> 01:39:42,519
...to raid our lands.

1104
01:39:44,760 --> 01:39:46,439
We were in a hard position.

1105
01:39:46,800 --> 01:39:48,119
But..

1106
01:39:48,320 --> 01:39:51,279
...we have never been worried.

1107
01:39:55,400 --> 01:39:56,559
Why?

1108
01:39:59,520 --> 01:40:01,999
Because there are brave men like Salur Bey.

1109
01:40:08,600 --> 01:40:11,639
We thank him. He opened his door to us.

1110
01:40:12,320 --> 01:40:13,679
He shed his blood.

1111
01:40:14,440 --> 01:40:16,399
He stood behind us

1112
01:40:17,000 --> 01:40:19,119
to his last breath.

1113
01:40:20,880 --> 01:40:22,319
Thank you.

1114
01:40:26,160 --> 01:40:28,399
You proved your capabilities.

1115
01:40:29,040 --> 01:40:30,399
From now on

1116
01:40:30,760 --> 01:40:33,279
you'll always have a place in my council.

1117
01:40:35,240 --> 01:40:39,159
The heart of people like you
always makes us hopeful.

1118
01:40:41,480 --> 01:40:42,879
Osman Bey.

1119
01:40:43,520 --> 01:40:46,279
Your da'wah of holy war is in our heart.

1120
01:40:50,560 --> 01:40:53,439
Alp, bring it here.

1121
01:41:16,360 --> 01:41:17,999
Salur Bey, here.

1122
01:41:22,560 --> 01:41:24,319
From now on

1123
01:41:25,720 --> 01:41:28,879
you'll always have a right to talk in my council.

1124
01:41:34,280 --> 01:41:36,559
May Allah bless you my Bey.

1125
01:41:37,040 --> 01:41:39,039
EyvAllah. EyvAllah.

1126
01:41:44,840 --> 01:41:47,079
The army headed towards us

1127
01:41:48,640 --> 01:41:51,479
has stopped before entering our lands.

1128
01:41:52,720 --> 01:41:54,599
What is their intention, my Bey?

1129
01:41:54,880 --> 01:41:57,839
Their intention is to break us.

1130
01:42:00,520 --> 01:42:03,159
Just like we tried to hit their commanders

1131
01:42:04,000 --> 01:42:06,679
they will want to do the same to us.

1132
01:42:08,960 --> 01:42:10,439
How do we know that, my Bey?

1133
01:42:10,920 --> 01:42:12,759
You, me

1134
01:42:13,160 --> 01:42:14,639
the competent warriors,

1135
01:42:14,880 --> 01:42:18,439
how can they disperse our army
before hitting us and other beys.

1136
01:42:18,760 --> 01:42:21,639
How can they raid these lands?

1137
01:42:24,160 --> 01:42:28,839
So the competent troop
will want to do this first.

1138
01:42:30,640 --> 01:42:32,079
Osman Bey.

1139
01:42:32,840 --> 01:42:35,199
Don't worry at all.

1140
01:42:35,960 --> 01:42:38,799
No one in this council

1141
01:42:39,000 --> 01:42:41,759
is afraid of death at all.

1142
01:42:45,840 --> 01:42:47,239
All right then.

1143
01:42:48,120 --> 01:42:50,639
Whatever their move is

1144
01:42:52,000 --> 01:42:54,679
our conquests will never stop.

1145
01:42:56,000 --> 01:42:57,999
No matter what their intentions are...

1146
01:42:58,120 --> 01:43:02,279
...they will never be able to come closer
to our dreams and our goals.

1147
01:43:03,720 --> 01:43:05,159
You may leave now.

1148
01:43:14,960 --> 01:43:17,119
Since you're watching us,

1149
01:43:17,800 --> 01:43:20,119
since you want to hit

1150
01:43:21,080 --> 01:43:23,799
I set up a great game for you Osman.

1151
01:43:36,000 --> 01:43:37,919
Come here

1152
01:43:38,120 --> 01:43:41,239
...and let me show you the picture
that Osman will see.

1153
01:43:55,560 --> 01:43:58,879
Armies will split into three here.

1154
01:43:59,920 --> 01:44:02,999
There are already a few men
and splitting them into three...

1155
01:44:03,000 --> 01:44:04,559
However!

1156
01:44:07,240 --> 01:44:11,399
The chosen ones will only be the number one..

1157
01:44:11,920 --> 01:44:13,079
..among these troops.

1158
01:44:15,280 --> 01:44:17,239
The other two are baits.

1159
01:44:22,160 --> 01:44:25,719
To split Osman into three and destroy them.

1160
01:44:29,800 --> 01:44:32,359
Will we use our soldiers as baits?

1161
01:44:34,080 --> 01:44:35,359
They are

1162
01:44:35,880 --> 01:44:38,799
Muslim hostages that were weaponized.

1163
01:44:41,080 --> 01:44:42,159
What if Osman

1164
01:44:42,400 --> 01:44:44,799
makes a move to destroy all three of them.

1165
01:44:45,000 --> 01:44:46,279
Let him do it.

1166
01:44:47,200 --> 01:44:48,999
Then he will die.

1167
01:44:50,800 --> 01:44:52,839
Because the chosen ones

1168
01:44:53,520 --> 01:44:56,319
are way more crowded than they seem.

1169
01:45:02,400 --> 01:45:04,119
If Osman

1170
01:45:04,280 --> 01:45:04,599
i c i

1171
01:45:04,760 --> 01:45:06,839
attacks the right way.

1172
01:45:08,600 --> 01:45:09,959
He will die.

1173
01:45:10,400 --> 01:45:10,759
<0

1174
01:45:12,960 --> 01:45:15,159
If he attacks the wrong way

1175
01:45:18,800 --> 01:45:22,399
the chosen ones will enter his lands,

1176
01:45:23,560 --> 01:45:25,319
and they'll destroy them all.

1177
01:45:29,880 --> 01:45:30,999
So,

1178
01:45:32,280 --> 01:45:36,039
we will be the victorious side
in both of these options.

1179
01:45:42,040 --> 01:45:43,359
Byzantium

1180
01:45:44,200 --> 01:45:45,959
should not be worried.

1181
01:45:47,040 --> 01:45:50,039
Osman, who dreams about conquests,

1182
01:45:53,760 --> 01:45:55,439
will die today.

1183
01:46:02,680 --> 01:46:05,279
Our conquests will never stop.

1184
01:46:06,320 --> 01:46:10,079
Our eyes have always been on Kestel,

1185
01:46:11,040 --> 01:46:14,199
Lefke and Koyunhisar.

1186
01:46:16,160 --> 01:46:19,559
But from now on, not only our eyes,

1187
01:46:20,400 --> 01:46:22,719
our swords will be there too.

1188
01:46:28,760 --> 01:46:30,159
Uraz Bey.

1189
01:46:31,880 --> 01:46:35,199
You'll have the Kestel Castle.
It will be a big siege.

1190
01:46:35,840 --> 01:46:37,039
Yes my Bey.

1191
01:46:37,800 --> 01:46:41,079
Demirhan Bey.
You'll have the Lefke Citadel.

1192
01:46:42,440 --> 01:46:44,119
Yes my bey.

1193
01:46:47,080 --> 01:46:49,399
When it conies to you, Salur Bey.

1194
01:46:53,280 --> 01:46:55,559
You'll deal with Gemlik.

1195
01:46:56,000 --> 01:46:57,479
Yes my Bey.

1196
01:47:00,320 --> 01:47:02,519
Osman Bey, forgive me but,

1197
01:47:05,520 --> 01:47:07,239
what is my duty?

1198
01:47:11,640 --> 01:47:13,839
You will be with me.

1199
01:47:16,200 --> 01:47:17,799
You will be with me from now on.

1200
01:47:22,800 --> 01:47:26,159
My Bey, the murderers of Lord Valens,

1201
01:47:26,720 --> 01:47:30,959
if we don't hit them, walking towards
conquests while the beys are on target...

1202
01:47:32,680 --> 01:47:35,919
The dogs bark, but the caravan goes on, Cerkutay.

1203
01:47:39,240 --> 01:47:40,639
We will not stop.

1204
01:47:41,200 --> 01:47:44,399
If we stop, then we will lose.

1205
01:47:44,960 --> 01:47:46,719
We will keep going.

1206
01:47:47,400 --> 01:47:50,679
Alps are watching the paths,
let us learn their move.

1207
01:47:51,600 --> 01:47:53,599
We will counteract even harder.

1208
01:47:57,160 --> 01:48:00,239
InshaAllah we will not let them
open their eyes my Bey.

1209
01:48:00,520 --> 01:48:02,679
EvelAllah.

1210
01:48:03,600 --> 01:48:05,639
May I come in my Bey?

1211
01:48:06,200 --> 01:48:07,519
Come on in.

1212
01:48:14,560 --> 01:48:18,679
My Bey, scouts watching the armies
have sent a message.

1213
01:48:18,880 --> 01:48:20,919
Lord dispersed the vanguard.

1214
01:48:20,920 --> 01:48:24,239
They're advancing in three separate ways cautiously.

1215
01:48:28,640 --> 01:48:30,319
Lord..

1216
01:48:34,640 --> 01:48:37,359
He wants to divide us into three.

1217
01:48:38,680 --> 01:48:42,279
Tell me. Which routes are they using?

1218
01:48:47,280 --> 01:48:51,639
My Bey, the first one is here.
The woods behind Kestel.

1219
01:48:52,920 --> 01:48:56,759
The other troop are going
along the river through the Gemlik road.

1220
01:48:57,160 --> 01:48:58,879
And the last one..

1221
01:48:59,000 --> 01:49:01,999
...is going along the mountain behind Iznik.

1222
01:49:02,320 --> 01:49:04,399
You mean here.

1223
01:49:05,120 --> 01:49:05,879
Here.

1224
01:49:08,840 --> 01:49:10,599
Lords..

1225
01:49:11,480 --> 01:49:15,239
They forgot how to read
the nature as they stayed in castles.

1226
01:49:16,000 --> 01:49:19,399
Now tell me. Which way..

1227
01:49:20,480 --> 01:49:22,999
...will the best troop take?

1228
01:49:29,360 --> 01:49:31,839
Riverside is where they can advance fastest.

1229
01:49:32,000 --> 01:49:33,599
They can reach Bursa...

1230
01:49:33,880 --> 01:49:35,999
...and the frontiers quickly.

1231
01:49:36,400 --> 01:49:39,119
Kestel woods will hide them, my Bey.

1232
01:49:39,280 --> 01:49:41,479
If they want to arrive safely,

1233
01:49:41,600 --> 01:49:43,839
...they will take that way.

1234
01:49:47,240 --> 01:49:50,359
You say mountains are only for goats.

1235
01:49:51,440 --> 01:49:53,919
Why would soldiers take that way, huh?

1236
01:49:56,600 --> 01:49:59,679
If the best troop want to hit us,

1237
01:50:00,840 --> 01:50:03,639
...they will definitely take that route.

1238
01:50:07,720 --> 01:50:09,799
The mountains of Iznik..

1239
01:50:10,000 --> 01:50:12,839
...will be where the best troop is.

1240
01:50:18,080 --> 01:50:20,639
-Can I, my Bey?
-Come in!

1241
01:50:27,680 --> 01:50:30,559
My Bey, we got a message from Constantinople.

1242
01:50:32,480 --> 01:50:34,599
EyvAllah.

1243
01:50:35,520 --> 01:50:37,159
EyvAllah.

1244
01:50:55,520 --> 01:50:58,359
Martalaus who is in Constantinople...

1245
01:50:59,440 --> 01:51:03,159
...mentions the same route.
The best troop is...

1246
01:51:04,320 --> 01:51:06,999
...going to pass here.

1247
01:51:13,680 --> 01:51:15,439
What are your orders, my Bey?

1248
01:51:15,960 --> 01:51:18,639
We've found out their routes.

1249
01:51:20,160 --> 01:51:23,479
Now we will show them our hospitality.

1250
01:51:24,320 --> 01:51:27,239
We'll let them listen to songs of our swords.

1251
01:51:32,840 --> 01:51:35,759
Now we will hit them hard.

1252
01:51:38,200 --> 01:51:40,639
Everyone on horses!

1253
01:51:51,880 --> 01:51:53,719
We're close.

1254
01:51:54,280 --> 01:51:57,159
Don't be afraid, Esrigun Hatun.

1255
01:51:57,920 --> 01:52:00,279
We'll find your spy alive, InshaAllah.

1256
01:52:00,400 --> 01:52:02,479
What would I be afraid of?

1257
01:52:04,680 --> 01:52:07,199
Well, heathens keep following us.

1258
01:52:07,960 --> 01:52:10,519
What would you do here alone without me?

1259
01:52:10,840 --> 01:52:13,439
My strength fears the enemy, Boran Alp.

1260
01:52:13,880 --> 01:52:16,519
I would manage without you.

1261
01:52:17,120 --> 01:52:18,439
EyvAllah.

1262
01:52:25,600 --> 01:52:28,119
Why are you carrying that?

1263
01:52:29,840 --> 01:52:32,079
After the last ambush we fell into

1264
01:52:32,240 --> 01:52:34,599
...I decided to keep it with me.

1265
01:52:35,080 --> 01:52:37,559
It knows Yenisehir and the mansion well.

1266
01:52:38,840 --> 01:52:40,839
And I'm supposed to protect you.

1267
01:52:41,320 --> 01:52:43,239
That's why I'm so cautious.

1268
01:52:49,240 --> 01:52:51,479
This is it.

1269
01:52:51,920 --> 01:52:54,239
Ayceren must have arrived by now.

1270
01:53:03,480 --> 01:53:04,959
Ayceren

1271
01:53:08,000 --> 01:53:10,239
-Ayceren!
-Be careful.

1272
01:53:12,160 --> 01:53:13,759
Ayceren?

1273
01:53:14,720 --> 01:53:16,599
Come on, come on

1274
01:53:25,400 --> 01:53:28,239
I was waiting for you, Esrigun

1275
01:53:29,120 --> 01:53:31,759
Your spy died in my hands!

1276
01:53:34,120 --> 01:53:36,399
I will take your breath away!

1277
01:53:37,520 --> 01:53:40,239
While you carry your head over your shoulders,

1278
01:53:40,600 --> 01:53:42,239
...I won't die but kill, Nayman

1279
01:53:42,560 --> 01:53:44,279
Attack!

1280
01:53:45,040 --> 01:53:48,679
You said your sword was solid.
Let's see if it is true.

1281
01:53:49,560 --> 01:53:51,199
You will see.

1282
01:54:10,040 --> 01:54:12,119
Ya Haqq!

1283
01:55:15,960 --> 01:55:17,199
Selamun aleykum.

1284
01:55:17,760 --> 01:55:20,199
Aleykum selam, valiants.

1285
01:55:23,520 --> 01:55:25,719
These are the last ones, Kumral Abdal.

1286
01:55:40,240 --> 01:55:42,239
What bothers you?

1287
01:55:45,080 --> 01:55:48,399
More than half of the sack
is full of stones, Kumral Abdal.

1288
01:55:49,080 --> 01:55:51,759
Fortunately, we looked in them at the shop...

1289
01:55:52,800 --> 01:55:54,519
...we took care of the issue.

1290
01:55:55,160 --> 01:55:56,879
But we were very upset.

1291
01:55:57,040 --> 01:56:00,119
My father works hard
and makes an effort for his people.

1292
01:56:00,240 --> 01:56:01,879
He always fights.

1293
01:56:02,480 --> 01:56:04,999
Look at what the traders are doing.

1294
01:56:05,240 --> 01:56:10,399
We dream of establishing a state.
Are we going to establish the state with these people?

1295
01:56:11,680 --> 01:56:13,599
Yes we are.

1296
01:56:17,080 --> 01:56:19,759
And no matter how hard you try to pick...

1297
01:56:20,240 --> 01:56:23,399
...stones will always be mixed with the wheat.

1298
01:56:26,360 --> 01:56:29,759
But we will always pick those stones.

1299
01:56:31,040 --> 01:56:32,639
Come on valiants.

1300
01:56:33,080 --> 01:56:34,559
Take these bags.

1301
01:56:35,320 --> 01:56:38,919
Two handfuls of wheat in each bag.

1302
01:56:57,640 --> 01:56:59,879
Time belongs to Allah, my Orhan.

1303
01:57:00,520 --> 01:57:02,719
People also belong to Allah.

1304
01:57:04,200 --> 01:57:06,039
But you should know..

1305
01:57:07,240 --> 01:57:09,599
...nothing happens because of time.

1306
01:57:13,760 --> 01:57:15,719
Just as the water of one mountain..

1307
01:57:16,040 --> 01:57:18,319
...resembles the water of another mountain..

1308
01:57:19,080 --> 01:57:22,879
...people are similar to each other...

1309
01:57:23,440 --> 01:57:25,839
...no matter what period they live in.

1310
01:57:28,520 --> 01:57:30,279
Think of Kabil.

1311
01:57:33,800 --> 01:57:36,119
When he was presenting his goods..

1312
01:57:36,120 --> 01:57:38,719
..he chose the worst ones.

1313
01:57:41,080 --> 01:57:42,719
But Habil..

1314
01:57:43,520 --> 01:57:45,079
..chose the best ones.

1315
01:57:49,080 --> 01:57:50,999
And it is the same now.

1316
01:57:51,400 --> 01:57:54,439
There is Kabil and Habil.

1317
01:57:56,880 --> 01:57:58,839
You are right, Kumral Abdal.

1318
01:57:59,680 --> 01:58:01,759
But still, I cannot stand it.

1319
01:58:02,840 --> 01:58:05,999
Sure you cannot.
We may not be able to stand it.

1320
01:58:06,560 --> 01:58:08,319
Wherever there is a mistake..

1321
01:58:08,920 --> 01:58:11,639
..something contrary to the will of Allah...

1322
01:58:12,040 --> 01:58:14,439
...we will correct it with our hands.

1323
01:58:15,320 --> 01:58:17,559
If we can't do it with our hands,

1324
01:58:17,720 --> 01:58:19,479
...we should do it by our tongues.

1325
01:58:19,560 --> 01:58:21,959
If our tongues aren't enough

1326
01:58:22,600 --> 01:58:23,879
..then..

1327
01:58:24,120 --> 01:58:28,359
...we should stand against that evil thing in our hearts.

1328
01:58:30,560 --> 01:58:34,119
Thanks to Allah, our hands were enough, Kumral Abdal.

1329
01:58:36,440 --> 01:58:38,359
What are these pouches for?

1330
01:58:40,880 --> 01:58:43,359
For what our hands are enough for.

1331
01:58:44,760 --> 01:58:48,239
Just like Hadhrat Omer (R.A) didn't let birds starve,

1332
01:58:48,600 --> 01:58:51,399
...Osman Bey won't either.

1333
01:58:52,720 --> 01:58:55,799
We prepared sacks for them.

1334
01:58:58,640 --> 01:59:02,559
We'll establish the state that we have been dreaming for.

1335
01:59:03,680 --> 01:59:07,639
We'll establish the state where we even provide for...

1336
01:59:07,840 --> 01:59:10,359
...even the birds and bugs in mountains.

1337
01:59:12,120 --> 01:59:13,759
We will.

1338
01:59:15,080 --> 01:59:16,399
We will.

1339
01:59:18,120 --> 01:59:20,599
Come on, boys. Come on.

1340
01:59:21,120 --> 01:59:24,359
Birds and bugs in mountains are hungry! Come on!

1341
01:59:28,560 --> 01:59:30,279
Hold this.

1342
01:59:56,320 --> 01:59:58,079
Wait, sister.

1343
02:00:09,640 --> 02:00:11,359
Fatma

1344
02:00:19,720 --> 02:00:21,359
Fatma?

1345
02:00:23,720 --> 02:00:25,559
Halime?

1346
02:00:25,840 --> 02:00:27,879
What are you doing here?

1347
02:00:33,520 --> 02:00:35,599
You've started walking?

1348
02:00:39,640 --> 02:00:41,039
No way.

1349
02:00:41,680 --> 02:00:43,479
Fatma

1350
02:00:45,000 --> 02:00:46,759
You must have done this, Fatma.

1351
02:00:46,760 --> 02:00:49,039
Malhun Hatun! Malhun Hatun!

1352
02:00:49,480 --> 02:00:51,399
Malhun Hatun

1353
02:00:53,160 --> 02:00:55,679
-What's the matter?
-Boran Alp.

1354
02:00:56,280 --> 02:00:59,319
-He got ambushed.
-Ambushed?

1355
02:01:03,600 --> 02:01:05,359
Give it to me.

1356
02:01:10,880 --> 02:01:12,319
Boran.

1357
02:01:13,120 --> 02:01:15,279
Alps, prepare the horses!

1358
02:01:15,440 --> 02:01:17,039
Bring the swords! Come on!

1359
02:01:17,120 --> 02:01:19,359
Malhun Hatun, you can't ride.

1360
02:01:19,480 --> 02:01:21,439
-For your baby.
-I have to.

1361
02:01:21,600 --> 02:01:23,479
They are in danger. We can't be late.

1362
02:01:23,520 --> 02:01:26,519
If you ride, I can't save the baby.

1363
02:01:28,040 --> 02:01:29,039
Malhun.

1364
02:01:29,360 --> 02:01:33,519
You come by the carriage.
I go ahead and let Bala know, alright?

1365
02:01:34,920 --> 02:01:36,279
Come on then.

1366
02:01:36,440 --> 02:01:39,239
Ulgen, take care of Fatma and Halime.

1367
02:02:10,040 --> 02:02:12,239
Well... Where is Fatma?

1368
02:02:13,080 --> 02:02:14,719
Fatma

1369
02:02:15,760 --> 02:02:18,039
Come! I will make cookies for you!

1370
02:02:30,320 --> 02:02:31,799
Boran.

1371
02:02:32,240 --> 02:02:33,439
I'm good.

1372
02:02:33,560 --> 02:02:36,199
Go into the woods. I will follow you. Go!

1373
02:02:36,200 --> 02:02:38,679
I'm not someone who leaves fellows behind.

1374
02:02:38,720 --> 02:02:40,999
We'll get out together or we won't.

1375
02:02:42,800 --> 02:02:43,839
Boran.

1376
02:03:43,520 --> 02:03:45,319
We're coming Boran

1377
02:03:46,200 --> 02:03:47,439
MashaAllah.

1378
02:03:47,520 --> 02:03:50,999
Come on, come on! Come on!

1379
02:03:52,440 --> 02:03:54,639
Allah is the greatest!

1380
02:03:57,240 --> 02:03:59,759
Alps, attack!

1381
02:04:39,920 --> 02:04:42,599
Allah is Hayy!

1382
02:04:43,040 --> 02:04:45,119
Allah is the greatest!

1383
02:04:45,680 --> 02:04:47,159
Ambush

1384
02:04:48,640 --> 02:04:51,359
Allah is the greatest!

1385
02:04:51,760 --> 02:04:54,159
Come on brothers!

1386
02:04:57,760 --> 02:04:59,839
Allah is the greatest!

1387
02:05:00,200 --> 02:05:05,559
Allah is the greatest!

1388
02:05:07,280 --> 02:05:11,519
Allah is the greatest!

1389
02:05:14,520 --> 02:05:16,359
We're drawing back!

1390
02:05:21,640 --> 02:05:23,959
-O Haqq!
-O Haqq!

1391
02:05:33,280 --> 02:05:36,199
-O Haqq!
-O Haqq!

1392
02:06:36,880 --> 02:06:38,799
Welcome to the land of Turks.

1393
02:06:39,200 --> 02:06:40,919
We were coming to you Osman.

1394
02:06:41,040 --> 02:06:43,519
We have come here so that you do not get tired.

1395
02:06:43,600 --> 02:06:48,319
After we kill your commanders and beys,
it was going to be your turn.

1396
02:06:49,280 --> 02:06:52,479
-You made it easy for us by coming early.
-Right.

1397
02:06:53,920 --> 02:06:56,399
That's what our religion orders us to do.

1398
02:06:56,480 --> 02:06:58,359
It says "do not make it hard...

1399
02:06:59,080 --> 02:07:00,599
...make it easier."

1400
02:07:01,280 --> 02:07:02,239
And..

1401
02:07:03,040 --> 02:07:05,159
Here, with our alps..

1402
02:07:05,800 --> 02:07:08,559
we are to make it easier for you.

1403
02:08:01,560 --> 02:08:03,119
So that's what it is.

1404
02:08:09,600 --> 02:08:11,399
The field is ours!

1405
02:08:11,560 --> 02:08:15,039
-O Allah!
-You will die in this field, Osman!

1406
02:09:21,520 --> 02:09:23,039
Allah is the greatest!

1407
02:09:23,360 --> 02:09:25,959
We will be the doom of infidels!

1408
02:09:26,280 --> 02:09:29,799
We will dig their graves!
Allah is the greatest!

1409
02:10:44,240 --> 02:10:45,479
Mother.

1410
02:10:49,840 --> 02:10:50,919
Fatma.

1411
02:10:52,960 --> 02:10:54,639
My daughter!

1412
02:10:56,760 --> 02:10:58,359
I wanted only one.

1413
02:10:58,760 --> 02:11:00,319
You came with ten.

1414
02:11:01,800 --> 02:11:03,239
Osman.

1415
02:11:03,880 --> 02:11:06,039
Your heart is in my hands.

1416
02:11:17,640 --> 02:11:19,319
Alp..

1417
02:11:20,120 --> 02:11:21,279
Mother.

1418
02:11:24,680 --> 02:11:25,959
Mother.

1419
02:11:26,800 --> 02:11:29,039
I will get your heart, Osman.

1420
02:11:32,040 --> 02:11:33,959
Fatma run

1421
02:11:36,200 --> 02:11:39,239
-Fatma run! Run!
-Mother.

1422
02:12:00,200 --> 02:12:01,879
Aktemur!

1423
02:12:27,080 --> 02:12:28,399
Cerkutay.

1424
02:13:06,800 --> 02:13:08,399
How could this happen?

1425
02:13:09,360 --> 02:13:11,279
How could this happen?

1426
02:13:22,040 --> 02:13:23,599
My Bey.

1427
02:13:53,240 --> 02:13:55,199
Allah is the greatest!

1428
02:13:55,680 --> 02:13:57,359
Allah is the greatest!

1429
02:14:09,680 --> 02:14:12,199
Allah is the greatest!

1430
02:14:26,680 --> 02:14:31,999
Allah is the greatest!

1431
02:14:45,560 --> 02:14:48,799
We will take a thousand lives for one life.

1432
02:14:52,260 --> 02:15:05,159
Visit our website for more: turkision.com